<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK- Ngulu Bible Version .</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">MBULI YEDI IWANDIKWE NI</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Luka ni kitabu kimwenga mwe vitabu vine ve Ndagano Im'pya vikulonga wikazi wa Yesu Kilisito. Vitabu ivo ivine nivo vikwitangwa Injili, nuko kugamba Mbuli Yedi, vawandikagwa ni Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohana, aho Yesu eze ande kabanika. Luka hawandikaga mbuli za wikazi wa Yesu du, mna iviyaiviya awandikaga mbuli wadamanyaga wanamp'hina wa Yesu aho eze ande kabanika no kuuyuka. Ayo yose wadamanye ye mwe kitabu kikwitangwa Imitendele ya wegala Ulosi. Hahali amanyize ikindedi kugamba Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Luka yawandikagwa ini na kuhi, mna wamanyi wengi wazumilana kugamba vadahika yawandikagwa mwo mwaka wa milongo mfungate kulawa aho Yesu eze elekwe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luka niye awandike kitabu iki, uyo andaga mganga. Imiwandikile yakwe no ulosi wakwe valagisa kugamba andaga mnt'hu mta umanyi. Luka aungaga kuwandika haheina kwazaganya mwo kutambalisa wikazi wa Yesu uku akatambalisa vedi ivo valailaga vileke want'hu watuhu wapate wambizi umwo wakasoma kitabu iki (Luka 1:1-3). Yehe handaga Myahudi. (Wakolosai 4:10-14) naho awandikaga aya vileke want'hu hi Wayahudi wadahe kukombaganya, ino yalagiswa pwilili ivo adahaga kutambalisa vihendo va Wayahudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Yedi ivo iwandikwe ni Luka yaligana na vitabu va Matayo na Maliko kwaviya vatambalisa mbuli zikuligana, naho kwa sila zikuligana. Luka atambalisa vedi vitendese mwo kwelekwa kwa Yohana Mbatizi, naho atigiza mwe mbuli yo kulekela malema, 3:3; 11:4; 17:3-4; 23:34; 24:47 na mbuli ya kumlombeza Mnungu, 3:21; 5:16; 6:12; 11:1-12; 22:32.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 1:1-4, Luka akonga kwa kutambalisa kilekile akawandika.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 1:5-4:13, Luka atambalisa ukwelekwa kwa Yesu na ivo akeikile lumwe kuidamanya indima yakwe.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 4:14-21:38, Luka atambalisa indima idamanywe ni Yesu vitendese vilagiso adamanye ne zimbuli ahinize.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwo mnango wa 22-24, Luka atambalisa kubanika kwa Yesu na kumoswa msanga kwakwe na kuuyuka kwakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mkulu Teofilo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Want'hu wengi wagezaga vedi kwaviya wadahile kuwandika izimbuli ze vint'hu vilaile mwetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Wawandikaga vint'hu viya kisimuilwe ni wadya waonaga vint'hu ivo kukongela nk'hongo, na wadya wabilikizaga Imbuli Yedi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Kwa ivo mkulu Teofilo, kwaviya name hizungula ukindedi we zimbuli izi kukongela nk'hongo, hiona vedi niwawandikile kwa uwedi vint'hu ivo vose vilaile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Hitenda ivi vileke weye nawe umanye kindedi che vint'hu vose uhinizwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yohana Mbatizi kwalotelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Umwo Helode andaga seuta ywa Uyahudi, handaga na mlava nt'hambiko zina dyakwe Zakalia. Uyo andaga yumwenga mwe difyo dya walava nt'hambiko dya Abiya. Mkaziwe etangagwa Elizabeti, naye andaga ni ywa lukolo lwa mlava nt'hambiko etangwe Haluni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Wose waidi wandaga wazumilwa kunda wedi ha meso ha Mnungu, naho waitozaga kwa kindedi Imiko yose ya Zumbe. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Wandaga hawana mwana kwaviya Elizabeti andaga hana cheleko, naho wose waidi wadalahalisaga.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Zuwa dimwenga Zakalia andaga mwe Nyumba nk'hulu ya Mnungu akadamanya ndima yakwe yo ulava nt'hambiko, enga ivo akudamanyaga mwo luzo lwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Viligane na ivo chandaga kihendo cha walava nt'hambiko, usaguzi wamgweelaga Zakalia kwingila mwe Nyumba nk'hulu ya Zumbe kufunk'hiza ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Fyo dya want'hu nadyo dyandaga dikuse dikamlombeza Mnungu umo ubani wandaga ukafunk'hizwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Niyo mtumigwa ywa Zumbe amlaila no kukimala hakulume he kilingo cho kufunk'hizila ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakalia eze amuone, etukaga na kwingilwa ni wogofi. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Mna yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu niyo amgamba Zakalia, “Usekogoha! Mnungu keva kulombeza kwako. Mkazio Elizabeti naakwelekele mwana kilume, nawe noumwitange niye Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Weye nawe nounde na kinyemi na kusekeela, naho want'hu wose nawande na kinyemi kwa kwelekwa kwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Naande mkulu ha Zumbe, naho haanywe divai hegu mp'hombe yoyose. Naamemezwe Muye ywa Mnungu kukongela dizuwa dyo kwelekwa kwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Naawavuze want'hu wengi wa Izilaeli kwa Zumbe Mnungu ywawe. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Naye naamlongoele Zumbe kwa Muye na ludole lwa Eliya, na aihitule mioyo ya welesi vileke waivane na wana wawe. Naawavuze want'hu wasaguke vileke wande wedi ha Mnungu no kumwiikila Mnungu want'hu waikilwe lumwe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakalia niyo amgamba mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu, “Nenimanye vivihi zimbuli izi? Miye hidalahala, naho hata mkazangu naye kadalahala.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo amgamba, “Ni miye Gabilieli hukimala ha Mnungu anitumile nize nilonge na weye na kukugambila mbuli ino iyedi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Mna kwaviya huhuwile ulosi wangu, houdahe kulonga mpaka mwe dizuwa idyo, aho zimbuli izo nezilaile.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Want'hu wandile kuse wakamgoja Zakalia, niyo weheelwa kwaviya ekalise kufosa kwe Nyumba ink'hulu ya Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Eze afosele kuse, niyo anda hakudaha kulonga nawo. Woho nawo niyo wabunk'hula kugamba nakaona maona mwe Nyumba nk'hulu ya Mnungu. Kwaviya andaga hakudaha kulonga, andaga akalonga nawo kwa vilagiso.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Zakalia eze abinde indima yakwe niyo auya kaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mageke, Elizabeti uyo mkaziwe niyo enula ubovu, ivo andaga hahalaile he nyumba yakwe kwa miezi mishano. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Niyo agamba, “Zumbe kanidamanyila mbuli ino! Haluse kanionela mbazi, naho kaniusila soni zangu mwa want'hu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yesu kwalotelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mwo mwezi wa mtandatu wo ubovu wa Elizabeti, Mnungu amtumaga mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu etangwe Gabilieli kwe isi ye Galilaya, mwo mzi ukwitangwa Nazaleti. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Nakanda na ulosi kwa mwali na mazanga akwitangwa Maliamu. Mndele uyu andaga katumizwa ni mgosi yumwenga etangagwa Yusufu, andaga ywo lukolo lwa zumbe Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu amwizilaga mwali uyo niyo amgamba, “Ndamsa! Zumbe e hamwenga na weye, naho kakuvikila vitendese.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maliamu engilwagwa ni kinyulu kwo ulosi udya wo mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu, naho niyo ehelwa mbuli idya nivo yagaaze. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Mna mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo amgamba, “Maliamu, usekogoha! Mnungu kakulagisa uwedi wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Kaula, nowinule ubovu, naho noweleke mwana kilume, zina dyakwe noumwitange niye Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Naande mkulu naho neetangwe Mwana ywa Mnungu e Kulanga. Zumbe Mnungu naamwink'he difumbi dyo useuta enga ivo andaga mkale ywakwe Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Naande Seuta ywe cheleko cha Yakobo mazuwa yose, naho uzumbe wakwe ni wa mazuwa yose!” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maliamu niyo amgamba yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu, “Miye ni mwali na mazanga. Elo neinde vihi mbuli ino?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo amhitula, “Muye ywa Mnungu naakwizile, naho ludole lwa Mnungu ekulanga nelukugubike. Kwaivo mwana akuunga elekwe neetangwe, akukile Mwana Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Naho, kaula nduguyo Elizabeti kenula ubovu wa mwana kilume mwo udala wakwe naho uno ni mwezi wa mtandatu. Naakalongwa hakudaha kweleka, mna ivi haluse mbovu ywa miezi mtandatu iivo adalahale. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Kwaviya hadihali Mnungu heekudaha kudidamanya!”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maliamu niyo amgamba, “Miye ni mndima ywa Zumbe, nevinde kwangu enga ivo ukulonga.” Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo ahalawa no kuita.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliamu amtalamkila Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Akajika aho, Maliamu niyo akeika lumwe na kusunguza kwiita kwo mzi umwe vigulu va isi ya Uyahudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Niyo engila kwe nyumba ye Zakalia na kumlamsa Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizabeti eze eve Maliamu akamlamsa, kazana kandaga mwe nda yakwe katugusaga. Elizabeti andaga kamemezwa Muye ywa Mnungu, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Weye kuvikilwa kujink'ha wavele wose, mwana naye ukuunga umweleke kavikilwa! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Nii mbuli ino ink'hulu ikanilaila miye, nine dya Zumbe ywangu akeza kunitalamkila? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nize nive du indamsa yako, kazana kwe zinda zangu niyo katugusa kwa kinyemi. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Kaula kinyemi unanacho weye uhuwile mbuli ya Zumbe, kwaviya neinde kindedi kwako.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa uwedi utendese wa Maliamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Maliamu niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Moyo wangu wamtogola Zumbe,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />no muye wangu welelwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:47">kwa mbuli ya Mnungu, Myokozi ywangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />kwaivo anikumbukile miye mndima ywakwe mkiwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kukongela dielo na kugendeela, want'hu wose nawanitange mvikilwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />kwe zimbuli zakwe zink'hulu Mnungu wo Udahi anidamanyile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Zina dya Mnungu dikuka.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Kukongela cheleko iki na kugendeela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">kalagisa mbazi kwa wadya wakumhuwila.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Kadamanya vint'hu vikulu kwa udahi wakwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Kawatenda wadya wakukefenya mwe mioyo yawe wasambale.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Kawakinya maseuta kulawa mwe difumbi dyo useuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">na kuwenula want'hu waoneke kunda wasokezi.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Kawegusa wata sala kwa vint'hu vedi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">naho kawagulusa wagoli heweena kint'hu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Kamwambiza mtumwa ywakwe Izilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">naho hajaile kulagisa zimbazi zakwe<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />kwa tati yetu Ibulahimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">hamwenga na cheleko chakwe mazuwa yose!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maliamu nakekala na Elizbeti miezi mitatu, niyo auya kaya kwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Lupisi lwa Elizabeti wa kweleka uze ubule, niyo eleka mwana kilume. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Want'hu we haguhi naye hamwenga na wanduguze weze weve ivo Zumbe kamuwonela mbazi, niyo wanda na kinyemi hamwenga naye.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Umwana eze abule mazuwa mnane, niyo want'hu wagenda kumvina. Waungaga wamwink'he zina niye Zakalia, idizina dya ise. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Mna nine niyo alemela no kuwagamba, “Bule! Dizina dyakwe neetangwe Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Niyo wamgamba, “Mna hahali mnt'hu mwe lukolo lwenyu mta dizina idyo?” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Niyo wamuuza ise kwa vilagiso vileke awagambile kugamba umwana etangwe ani.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakalia niyo alombeza kabao kakwe kwo kuwandikila, niyo awandika mwe kabao kadya, “Zina dyakwe niye Yohana.” Want'hu wose niyo weheleswa! <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Ahadya Zakalia adahaga kulonga naho, niyo akonga kumtogola Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Want'hu we haguhi naye wengilwagwa ni wogofi, niyo imbuli idya yagendezwa mwe vigulu ve isi ya Uyahudi. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Naho wose weviga zimbuli izo niyo nawakeuza mwe mioyo yawe, “Mwana uyu na ande mwana ywa vivihi? Kwaviya ludole lwa Zumbe lwihamwenga naye.”<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulotezi wa Zakalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakalia, ise dya Yohana niyo amemezwa Muye ywa Mnungu, niyo akonga kulotela.<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Atogolwe Zumbe, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Kwaviya keza kuwambiza want'hu wakwe no kuwakombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Kakikimalisila uyokozi una ludole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">mwe nyumba ya Daudi mndima ywakwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Enga ivo alongaga kwa milomo ya walotezi wakwe wakukile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">kukongela uko kale<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kugamba naakiyokole kulawa mwa wank'hondo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kulawa mwo ludole lwa wadya wose wakukiihiya.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Nakagamba nawaonele mbazi wakale wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">naho naakumbukile ndagano yakwe ikukile.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Amlaganaga Ibulahimu mkale ywetu<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />kugamba naakikombole suwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">kulawa mwe mikono ya waihi wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">Naho naakitende kidahe kumdamanyila ndima haheina wogofi,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kwa kukuka na kuzumilwa kunda wedi hameso hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">mwa mazuwa yose yo ugima wetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Nawe mwanangu, nowitangwe mlotezi ywa Mnungu ekulanga vitendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Kwaviya noumlongoele Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">umdamanyile isila,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />kuwagambila want'hu wakwe kugamba nawayokolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa kuusilwa wavu wawe.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Kwe zimbazi no uwedi wa Mnungu ywetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">akink'ha ung'azi wa ukombola kulawa kwe mbingu,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />awang'azile want'hu wose wakwikala kwe kizuli che file,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na kuzilongoza nk'hacho zetu mwe sila yo utondowazi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Yudya mwana niyo akula akongozekela umwili hamwenga no muye. Niyo ekala kwe nyika mpaka mwe dizuwa diya awalailaga want'hu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayo 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mazuwa yadya, Agusto, seuta ywa Kilumi asigiilaga kugamba luwandikwe ludongo lwa mazina ya want'hu wose mwe isi zose. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ludongo ulu nulo lwandaga lwa nk'hongo want'hu kuwazigwa, aho Kolinelio andaga mkulu wa isi ya Asilia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Ivo want'hu wose niyo wagenda kuwazigwa kwawe kila yumwenga.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusufu naye ahalawaga kwo mzi wa Nazaleti mwo mkowa wa Galilaya, niyo akwela kuita Uyahudi mwo mzi wa Betelehemu, hant'hu elekagwa zumbe Daudi. Nakaita ukwo kwaviya yehe andaga mwo lukolo lwa Daudi <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />vileke awandikwe hamwenga na Maliamu, uyo amposaga, mna andaga mbovu. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Umwo wandaga uukwo, mazuwa ya Maliamu yo kwingila nyumba yabulaga. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Niyo amweleka mwana kilume wa nk'hongo, no kumvika suke za difumbiti, niyo amtambalika mwo luhondo lwo kudiila ng'ombe kwaviya hahandaga na hant'hu mwe nyumba ya wageni.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wadimi na Watumigwa wa kwe mbingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Naho mwe isi idya kwandaga na wadimi wakwikala mwe zink'honde wakudima ngoto zawe kwa luzo nekilo.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">2. Wadimi wandima zingoto</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Niyo mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu awalaila, uwedi wa zumbe utendese wa Zumbe niyo wawang'aila nt'hendelo zose, niyo wengilwa ni wogofi mkulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Yudya mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu niyo awagamba, “Msekogoha! Nawegailani mbuli yedi ya kinyemi kikulu kwa want'hu wose. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Kwaviya dielo mwo mzi wa Daudi kelekwa Myokozi ywenyu, nuyo Zumbe Kilisito. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Na iki nicho kilagiso kwenyu. Namumbwile mwana, kavikigwa suke za mwana, naho katambalikwa mwo luhondo lwo kudiila ng'ombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ahadya fyo kulu dya watumigwa wa kwe mbingu kulawa kulanga dyadugana na yudya mtumigwa yumwenga, niyo wakonga kumtogola Mnungu wakagamba,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Uwedi utendese ni wa Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na utondowazi kwa want'hu elelwe nawo mwe isi!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Watumigwa wadya weze wauye Kulanga, wadya wadimi niyo wagambana, “Haya kiteni mpaka Betelehemu kikakaule idyo dilaile, kigambilwe ni Zumbe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Niyo wasunguza kuita, wawabwila Maliamu hamwenga na Yusufu na yudya mwana katiti katambalikwa mwo luhondo lwo kudiila ng'ombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Wadimi awo weze wakaone katiti niyo wasimuila viya mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu awagambile mwe mbuli ya yudya mwana katiti. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Wose wevile niyo wehelwa kwa ayo wagambilwe ni wadimi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mna Maliamu niyo awiika ulosi uwo wose akaufanyanya mwo moyo wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Wadya wadimi niyo wauya kwe nyika, wakamwink'ha uwedi utendese na kumtogola Mnungu kwa mbuli zose wevile na kuwona enga ivo mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu awagambilaga.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana enk'higwa zina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Yeze yabule mazuwa mnane, zuwa dyo kumvina mwana dize dibule, niyo wamwink'ha zina niye Yesu. Dizina idyo nakenk'higwa ni mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu kukongela aho andaga akei kwelekwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kwe Nyumba Nk'hulu ya Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Lupisi lwabulaga lwa Yusufu hamwenga na Maliamu kudamanya kihendo cho kukukizwa enga viya miko ya Musa ivo ikulonga. Niyo wamguha umwana na kumwigala kwo mzi wa Yelusalemu kumwigala kwa Zumbe <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />enga viya iwandikwe mwe miko ya Zumbe kugamba, “Kila mwana kilume kifungula nda aungwa kwigalwa hameso ya Zumbe.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Niyo wagenda kulava malavo enga viya ikuungwa mwe miko ya Zumbe. “Suwa mbili hegu makinda maidi ya mp'hugi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Mwo lupisi kiya, hadya Yelusalemu handaga na mnt'hu yumwenga zina dyakwe Simioni. Mnt'hu uyo andaga ywedi, akumwogoha Mnungu. Naakagoja kwiza kwo kusangalazwa kwa wa Izilaeli, na Muye ywa Mnungu andaga na yehe. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Naye nakagambilwa ni Muye ywa Mnungu kugamba haabanike uneva akei kumuwona Kilisito ywa Zumbe. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Welesi wa Yesu weze wamwigale umwana kwe Nyumba Ink'hulu ya Mnungu vileke wamdamanyile enga ivo miko ya Musa ikuwaunga, niyo Muye ywa Mnungu amlongoza Simoni kwingila kwe nyumba iyo Ink'hulu ya Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simoni niyo amhokela umwana mwe mikono yakwe, niyo amtogola Mnungu akagamba,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Haluse Zumbe mlekele mtumwa ywako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">aite mp'heho, enga ivo ulongile.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Kwaviya kwa meso yangu hiuona ukombola wako,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />uutendile uoneke kwa want'hu wose.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ung'azi wa kulagisa viya ukuunga weye kwa want'hu hi Wayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">no kunda uwedi utendese wako kwa want'hu wako wa Izilaeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Ise na nine ywa Yesu niyo wehelwa kwa yadya yandile yakalongwa ni Simoni. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simioni niyo awavikila, akamgamba Maliamu nine dya Yesu, “Kaula, mwana uyu kasagulwa ni Mnungu kwa kugwa na kwinuka kwa want'hu wengi mwe Izilaeli. Naande kilagiso kulawa kwa Mnungu, na want'hu wengi nawamnemele. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />We mwenye nawe dibamba nadikwingile mo umoyo wako vileke zigubulwe fanyanyi za mioyo mingi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Nahanda na mlotezi yumwenga we kivele, dizina dyakwe Ana mwana wa Fanueli we kabila dya Asheli. Mvele uyu nakekala na mgosi kwa myaka mfungate kukongela ukulombigwa kwakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Niyo andaga abanikilwe ni mgosiwe, na lupisi icho andaga na myaka milongo mnane na mine. Lupisi chose icho andaga hakulawa mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, andaga Umwo kilo na msi akavika kwa kufunga ukudya na kulombeza. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Isa iidya, mvele uyo alaila na kumtogola Mnungu no kulonga mbuli za yudya mwana kwa want'hu wose wandile wakaugoja ukombola wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusufu na Maliamu weze wajike kuyadamanya yose enga viya yasigilwe mwe miko ya Zumbe, niyo wauya Galilaya mpaka kwo mzi wawe wa Nazaleti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Yudya mwana niyo akula, ongezeka ludole, amema zihekima na uwedi wa Mnungu neziinda na yehe.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga Yesu mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Welesi wakwe Yesu nawenda na kihendo cha kwiita Yelusalemu kila mwaka mwa mazuwa ya zuwa dya kinyemi ye Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Mbwanga Yesu eze abule myaka mlongo na miidi, niyo waita Yelusalemu enga viya kihendo kikuwaunga. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Weze wabinde zuwa dya kinyemi, niyo wakonga kuuya kaya. Yesu niyo asigala Yelusalemu haheina welesi wakwe kumanya. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Woho nawakafanyanya kugamba e hamwenga na fyo dya want'hu mo utafi, niyo wagenda msi mgima. Niyo wakonga kumzungula kwa ndugu zawe hamwenga na wambuya zawe. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Weze wamswese, niyo wauya Yelusalemu wakamzungula.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Mwe dizuwa dya katatu, niyo wambwila mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu kekala hamwenga na wahinizi we Kiyahudi, nakawategeleza na kuwauza mbuli. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Woseni wamtegeleze niyo wahelwa kwa yadya mahituzi yakwe viya yendile ya ubala. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Welesi wakwe weze wamuwone, niyo weheleswa. Nine niyo amgamba, “Mwanangu, ni mbwai ukakitenda ivi? Kaula, miye na tati yako nekinda kikakuzungula kwa kwangadika.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Kwa mbwai kunizungula? Hammanyize kugamba hiungigwa ninde mwe nyumba ya Tate?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Mna woho hawakombaganye ulosi uwo awagambile. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Niyo auya nawo Nazaleti, naye andaga akawategeleza. Nine niyo ayaika ayo yose mo umoyo wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu niyo ongezekela kukula na kunda na mizungu, akamwelela Mnungu hamwenga na want'hu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Mabilikizi ya Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mwaka wa mlongo na mishano wo useuta wakwe seuta ywa Kilumi etangwe Tibeliyo, Pontio Pilato andaga mkulu we isi ya Uyahudi na Helode naye andaga mkulu wa Galilaya na Filipo nduguye andaga mkulu wa Ituleya ne isi ya Tilakoniti, Lisania andaga mkulu we Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Anasi na Kayafa wandaga wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko. Lupisi ulo Mbuli ya Mnungu yamwizilaga Yohana mwana Zakalia ukwo kwe nyika. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Niyo aita kila hant'hu mwe isi yose yo mto Yolodani akawabilikiza want'hu, “Lekeni uwavu wenyu mkabatizwe, Mnungu naawausileni uwavu wenyu.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Enga viya iwandikwe mwe kitabu cho mlotezi ywa Mnungu Isaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Mnt'hu akubongeela kwe nyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Ikeni lumwe sila ya Zumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">chululeni lwombokelo lwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Kila kolongo dyaungwa kusilizwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">na kila lugulu na kagulu nevitunyulwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Sila zigonjile zaungwa kugololwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">sila za makolongo zaungwa kusalahazwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Naho want'hu wose nawauone ukombola wa Mnungu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Niyo Yohana awagamba want'hu wambasile vileke wabatizwe, “Nyuwe cheleko che nyoka! Ni ani awagambileni kugamba mwadaha kunyilika maya ya Mnungu yakwiza? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Lagiseni kwa udamanyi kugamba muuleka uwavu wenyu. Naho msekukegamba, ‘Ibulahimu ni tati yetu!’ Nawagambilani, Mnungu adaha kuguha maiwe aya niyo amdamanyila Ibulahimu welekwa mwa maiwe aya! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Na ivo haluse hoya diikigwa kale mwe zink'holo ze miti, mti wowose howiina cheleko chedi nousengwe no kokigwa mwo moto.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Want'hu niyo wamuuza, “Haluse kitende vivihi?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Niyo awahitula, “Mta nk'hazu mbili naamwink'he heena nk'hazu, naho mta nk'hande atende iivo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Wakuduganya kodi nao niyo weza wakaunga kubatizwa. Niyo wamuuza, “Mhinizi, suwe naswe kitende vivihi?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Niyo awahitula, “Msekuguha vint'hu kujink'ha viya mkuungwa kuguha.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Watowani watuhu nao niyo wamuuza, “Suwe naswe kidamanyei?” Niyo awahitula, “Msekuguha matundu kwa mnt'hu yeyose haheina mwivano, naho mzumilane na maliho yenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Kwaviya want'hu nawanda wakagoja kwiza kwa Kilisito, ivo niyo wakonga kukeuza mwe mioyo yawe, mwe mbuli ya Yohana “Hangi uyu niye Kilisito?” <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yohana niyo awahitula, “Miye nawabatizani na mazi, mna eza mta ludole kunijink'ha miye. Miye hina wedi hata kunda mtumwa ywakwe. Yehe naawamibatizeni kwa Muye ywa Mnungu na kwa moto wa usengelo. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Uyo ana lungo mwo mkono wakwe, ahetele ngano yakwe na kuiika mwe digulu dyakwe, mna mahofya naayoke mwo moto houkuzima.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Naho kwa milosi mituhu mingi Yohana nakawabilikiza want'hu Mbuli Yedi. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Mna Yohana nakamtivila zumbe Helode, mkulu wa Galilaya kwaviya nakamlomba Helodiya, mkaza mvunawe, na kwa vint'hu vituhu vingi viihile ivo Helode adamanye. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Niyo Helode adamanya wiihi utendese kwa kumgela Yohana mwe divugailo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abatizwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Want'hu wose weze wajike kubatizwa, niyo Yesu naye abatizwa. Umwo andile akalombeza Mnungu, mbingu niyo zagubuka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Muye ywa Mnungu niyo aseela no kumkima mnanga mwakwe enga wa suwa. Naho izwi dyevikaga kulawa kwe mbingu dikagamba, “Weye niwe mwanangu, hukuungisa. Weye kunelela.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayo 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu akongaga ndima yakwe umwo akanda na myaka milongo mitatu. Want'hu wandaga wakagamba andaga mwana Yusufu, mwana Eli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Eli andaga mwana wa Matati, andile mwana Lawi, mwana Meliki, mwana Yana, mwana Yusufu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />andile mwanawe Matatiya, mwana Amosi, mwana Nahumu, mwana Esili, mwana Nagai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />andile mwana Maati, mwana Matatiya, mwana Semeyi, mwana Yoseki, mwana Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />andile mwana Yoana, mwana Lesa, mwana Zelubabeli, mwana Shealitieli, mwana Neli, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />mwana Meliki, mwana Adi, mwana Kosamu, mwana Elimadamu, mwana Eli, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />andile mwana Yoshua, mwana Eliezeli, mwana Yolimu, mwana Matati, mwana Lawi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />andile mwana Simioni, mwana Yuda, mwana Yusufu, mwana Yonamu, mwana Eliakimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />andile mwana Meleya, mwana Mena, mwana Matasa, mwana Natani, mwana Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />andile mwana Yese, mwana Obedi, mwana Boazi, mwana Salimoni, mwana Nahashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />andile mwana wa Aminadabu, mwana Alamu, mwana Heziloni, mwana Pelesi, mwana Yuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />andile mwana Yakobo, mwana Isaka, mwana Ibulahimu, mwana Tela, mwana Naholi, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />andile mwana Selugi, mwana Lagau, mwana wa Pelegi, mwana Ebeli, mwana Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />andile mwana Kenani, mwana Alifakisadi, mwana Shemu, mwana Nuhu, mwana Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />andile mwana Metusela, mwana Henoko, mwana Yaledi, mwana Mahalaleli, mwana wa Kenani. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Andile mwana Enoshi, mwana Seti, mwana Adamu, mwana Mnungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayo 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu eze afose mwo mto Yolodani, andaga na udahi mkulu wa Muye ywa Mnungu. Niyo uyo Muye amlongoza kuita mpaka kwe dijangwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Uko agezagwa nu Mwavu kwa mazuwa milongo mine. Mazuwa ayo yose, andaga hakudya kint'hu, niyo akeiva sala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Mwavu niyo amgamba, “Uneva weye niwe Mwana wa Mnungu, digambe diiwe idi dinde mkate.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Iwandikwa, ‘Mnt'hu haande mgima kwa ludyo du.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Mwavu niyo akweza Yesu kwo lunenengwa no kumlagisa useuta wose we isi yose kwa lupisi lugihi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Mwavu niyo amgamba, “Nohwink'he weye useuta wose na uwedi wakwe utendese kwaviya vose vimwe mikono yangu, name namwink'ha yoyose enga ivo huunga. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ivo vose nevinde vako weye uneva unanivika.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Iwandikwa, ‘Mvike Zumbe, Mnungu ywako du, naho umdamanyile ndima yehe du!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Naho Mwavu niyo amwigala Yesu aite Yelusalemu no kumkweza kwo lunenengwa lwe nyumba nk'hulu ya Mnungu. Niyo amgamba, “Uneva weye niwe Mwana Mnungu, keduule hasi <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />kwaviya iwandikwa, ‘Mnungu naawagambe watumigwa vileke wakwamile, <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />wakupoele mwe mikono yawe vileke usekukobadisa ikiga chako mwe diiwe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Mna Yesu niyo ahitula, “Iwandikwa, ‘Usekumgeza Zumbe Mnungu ywako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Aho Mwavu eze abinde kumgeza kwa kila sila, amnekaga kwa lupisi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akonga indima yakwe uko Galilaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu niyo auya mwe isi ya Galilaya, kamema ludole lwa Muye ywa Mnungu. Niyo mbuli zakwe zagendezwa Galilaya na mwe si zose zi mgihi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Naye andaga akahiniza mwe nyumba za Mnungu, naho andaga akatogolwa ni want'hu wose.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alemelwa uko Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Niyo Yesu aita Nazaleti, hant'hu alekelwe. E enga ivo kili kihendo chakwe Yesu, mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula engila mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu niyo akimaala vileke asome Mawandiko Yakukile. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Niyo enk'higwa kitabu cha mlotezi Isaya. Akigubulaga, niyo asoma hant'hu hawandikwe kugamba,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Muye wa Zumbe wimnanga mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">kwaviya kanisagula miye niwabilikize wakiwa mbuli yedi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Naho kanisigiila hawagambile wavugailwa kulekelwa kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">na mant'hunt'hu kuwona vituhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">no kuwakombola wata makunt'ho.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Hamwenga na kubilikiza kugamba lupisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">lwa Zumbe lwa kuwakombola want'hu wakwe lubula.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Niyo Yesu akigubika ikitabu no kumwink'ha mndima, niyo ekala. Want'hu wose wandile mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu wamn'goelaga meso.<verse eid="LUK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Akongaga kuwagamba, “Mawandiko aya diyelo yakint'ha enga ivo mwivile.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Want'hu wose wamzumilaga wakehelwa kwa milosi yo uwedi ayo alongaga. Wakagamba, “Ivi uyu hiyo mwana Yusufu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Himanya nomnigambile mliganyizo uno kugamba, ‘Mlaguzi kelagule mwenye! Mbuli zose kivile uzidamanye uko Kapelinaumu, zidamanye aha naho he isi yako mwenye.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Niyo agendeela kuwagamba, “Mlotezi hakuzumilwa mwe isi yakwe mwenye.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />“Mna nawagambilani ikindedi handaga na wavele wengi wafiilagwa ni wagosi zawe mwe isi ya Izilaeli mwo lupisi ulo Eliya andaga aho. Lupisi ludya fula hainyele kwa myaka mitatu na miezi mtandatu niyo kwanda na gumbo kulu mwe isi yose. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Mna Eliya niyo hatumigwe kwa mnt'hu yeyose mwe isi ya Izilaeli ila kwa abanikilwe ni mgosiwe andile akekala Salefati mwe isi ya Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Naho mwo lupisi lwa mlotezi Elisha, nahanda na want'hu wengi wata matana mwe isi ya Izilaeli. Mna hahali mnt'hu yoyose akukizwe mna ni Naamani du, mnt'hu wa isi ya Siliya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Want'hu wose wandile mwe idya Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu weze weve zimbuli izo, niyo wengila maya. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Niyo walundumka, no kumfoseza Yesu kuse kwo mzi no kumkweza ho lunenengwa vileke wamdule hasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Mna yeye niyo omboka mgati mwawe niyo akeitila.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu mta mp'hepo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maliko 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Niyo aita mpaka Kapelinaumu, mzi wi Galilaya. Ukwo ahinizaga mwe dizuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Niyo weheeleswa kwa mahinizo yakwe kwaviya andaga akahiniza kwa udahi. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mdya mwe idya Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, mwandaga na mnt'hu mta mp'hepo aihile. Niyo agutila akagamba, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Uuwi! Yesu wa Nazaleti, waunga ukitendei? Kwiza ukikome? Hikumanya kugamba weye niwe ani. Weye wi Akukile ywa Mnungu!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu niyo aitivila idya imp'hepo iihile, “Nyamala, naho umlawe mnt'hu uyo!” Niyo mp'hepo idya yamkinya hasi uyo mnt'hu mgati mwawe no kumfosa haheina kumlumiza.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Want'hu wose niyo wehelwa no kukonga kuuzana kugamba, “Ino mbuli yani? Mnt'hu uyu ana udahi na ludole lwa kuwativila mp'hepo waihile, nawo niyo wafosa!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ivo mbuli za Yesu niyo zagendezwa kila hant'hu mwe isi idya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awahonya want'hu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu afosaga Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, niyo aita kwe inyumba ya Simoni. Nine dya mkaziwe Simoni andaga mwo lusazi hakudaha, niyo wamlombeza Yesu vileke amhonye. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu niyo akimala hagihi na yudya mvele, aufank'hila udya unyonge niyo wamlekela. Ahadya niyo mvele yudya enuka no kuwadamanyila ndima.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Zuwa dize diswe, want'hu wose niyo wamwigaila Yesu want'hu wata maine ye hengi, niyo aika mikono yakwe mnanga mwa kila yumwenga no kuwahonya wose. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Mp'hepo nawo niyo wawalawa want'hu wengi wakagutila wakagamba, “Weye wi Mwana Mnungu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Yesu niyo awafank'hila, naho hawalekele walonge kwaviya nawammanya kugamba nuyo Kilisito.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abilikiza mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Kwize kuche, Yesu niyo afosaga niuyo aita hant'hu haheina want'hu. Want'hu niyo wakonga kumzungula, weze wamuwone waunga wamlemeze asekuhalawa kwawe. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Mna niyo awagamba, “Naungwa habilikize Mbuli Yedi ya Useuta wa Mnungu mwe mizi mituhu, kwaviya iki niicho Mnungu anisiigile kudamanya.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Niyo abilikiza mwe zinyumba zo kumvika Mnungu mwe isi ya Uyahudi.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga wanamp'hina wa nk'hongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu andaga kakimala hank'handa he diziwa dya Genezaleti. Want'hu wengi nawammemela no kukefint'hafint'ha wakategeleza Mbuli ya Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Niyo aona ngalawa mbili zandile mnk'handa mwe diziwa zilekigwe ni walowa wandile wakasunt'ha zinyavu zawe. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu niyo engila mwe ngalawa imwenga, naho neinda yakwe Simoni, niyo amuunga aigale hale ludodo kulawa mnk'handa mwe diziwa. Yesu ekalaga mnanga mwe ngalawa no kukonga kuhiniza.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Eze abinde kulonga, niyo amgamba, “Simoni igale, ingalawa kwa mazi matali vileke mkalowe zisamaki.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni niyo amhitula, “Zumbe,” “kidamanya ndima kilo kigima haheina kupata kint'hu chochose. Mna kwaviya weye kulonga, chalowa naho!” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Weze wadule zinyavu, niyo walowa samaki nyingi vitendile zinyavu zawe zinde hagihi na kukant'hika. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Niyo wawahungila mikono weyawe wandile mwe ngalawa nt'huhu weze wawambize. Niyo weza no kumemeza samaki mwe ngalawa zose mbili, nazo zaungaga kudidimila mwe mazi. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Petulo eze aone diya dilaile, niyo amfikila madi Yesu, agamba, “Zumbe, halawe hangu! Miye ni mta wavu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni hamwenga na weyawe niyo wehelwa kwa zisamaki zinyingi wapatile. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Naho weyawe wa Simoni, Yakobo na Yohana wana wa Zebedayo nawo wehelwa. Yesu niyo amgamba Simoni, “Usekogoha, kukongela ivi haluse nounde walowa want'hu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Niyo zingalawa zawe wazigamiza mp'wani, walekaga kila kint'hu niyo wamtimila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mta matana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yesu eze atende emwe mzi umwenga, nahenda na mnt'hu mta matana. Naye eze amwone Yesu, niyo amfikila madi no kumnombeza, niyo agamba, “Zumbe, ukaunga, wadaha kunisunt'ha!”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu naye niyo akusula umkono wakwe, amdosa na kumgamba, “Naunga, sunt'hika!” Ahadya matana niyo yamlawa mnt'hu yudya. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Usekumgambila mnt'hu yoyose imbuli ino. Mna ita ukakilagise kwa mlava nt'hambiko, ukalave malavo kwa mbuli ya kusunt'hika kwako enga viya Musa alagize uleke want'hu wose wamanye kugamba kuhona.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Mna izimbuli za Yesu niyo zatendesa kugendezwa kila hant'hu. Want'hu wengi niyo weza wakamtegeleza na kuhonyigwa maine yawe. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Mna Yesu niyo aita hant'hu haheina want'hu, niyo amlombeza Mnungu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mnt'hu aholole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu andaga akahiniza. Mafalisayo wamwenga hamwenga na wahinizi wa Sigilizi walaile mwe kila mzi wa Galilaya na Yudeya na Yelusalemu nawanda aho. Na udahi wa Zumbe nawinda aho uleke ahonye. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Niyo weza want'hu wenule mwo lusazi mnt'hu aholomp'hale. Nawakaunga wamwigale kundani uko andaga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Mna kwaviya want'hu nawamema, niyo wadunduga kumwigala kundani. Ivo wamkwezaga kulanga kwe nyumba, niyo waponk'hola langa no kumseleza mwo lusazi lwakwe na kumwika hagati he difyo dya want'hu, hameso ha Yesu. Want'hu wane wakamseleza mnyonge mwe dilanga Lowering Man Through the Roof. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu eze aone mhuwi wawe, niyo amgamba yudya mnyoge, “Mbuyangu, kuusilwa wavu wako.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Niyo wahinizi we zimiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo wakongaga kulafya wakagamba, “Uyu ni ani akumlonga vihile Mnungu? Ni ani akudaha kuusila uwavu? Mnungu ekedu niye akudaha kuusila uwavu!”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu nakamanya viya wakubanikanyanya, niyo awagamba, “Nii mwafanyanya mbuli izo mwe mioyo yenyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Dihuhile ni dihi, kugamba, ‘Kuusilwa uwavu wako,’ hegu kugamba, ‘Inuka uite’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Mna naunga mmanye kugamba, Mwana wa Mnt'hu ananao udahi wo kuwausila want'hu uwavu wawe.” Niyo amgamba yudya mnt'hu aholomp'hale, “Nakugamba, kimala, inula lusazi lwako wite kaya kwako!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ahadya mnt'hu yudya niyo akimaala hameso yawe, niyo aketwika lusazi lwakwe, niyo aita kaya kwake uku akamtogola Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Want'hu wose niyo weheleswa na kwingilwa ni wogofi, niyo wamtogola Mnungu wakagamba, “Dyelo kiona mbuli za kwehela!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amwitanga Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Akajika, Yesu niyo afosa kuse. Amuonaga mnt'hu andile akakisanya kodi akwitangwa Lawi kekala he nyumba ya kukisanyila kodi. Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nitimile.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lawi niyo enuka, niyo aleka kila kint'hu no kumtimila Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Akajika Lawi niyo amdamanyila Yesu wila mkulu mwe nyumba yakwe. Fyo kulu dya watoza kodi hamwenga na want'hu watuhu wandaga aho. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Niyo Mafalisayo wamwenga hamwenga na wahinizi wamwenga we miko walaile mwe difyo dyawe wakongaga kuwakalaliza wanamp'hina wa Yesu wakagamba, “Nii mwadya no kunywa hamwenga na wakutoza kodi na wata uwavu?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Want'hu wagima hawakumuunga mlaguzi, mna wanyonge nayo wakumuunga mlaguzi. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Hizile kuwetanga want'hu wedi ila wata wavu wakweiile wavu wawe, ila wata wavu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auzwa mbuli yo kufunga ukudya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Niyo want'hu wamwenga wamgambaga Yesu, “Nkanana nyingi wahamp'hina wa Yohana hamwenga na wa Mafalisayo wafunga na kumlombeza Mnungu, mna wanamp'hina wako wadya no ukunywa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ivi want'hu walalikwe kwe ndoza wadaha vivihi kufunga wakanda hamwenga no mlombi? Haikudahika! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Mna mazuwa nayeze hadya mlombi akuunga ahauswe. Mna nedize zuwa aho mlombi neze auswe kwawe, aho niho nawafunge.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Niyo Yesu awagambila mliganyizo, “Hahali mnt'hu akusenga kilaka kulawa mwe suke mp'hya na kukigela mwe suke isakale. Uneva anadamanya ivo, naatatule idya suke mp'hya, naho kiya kilaka che idya suke mp'hya hakiligane ne suke ibunt'hike. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Naho hahali mnt'hu akugela divai mp'hya mwe vizembe visakale. Uneva anatenda ivo, idya idivai imp'ya neivitule viya vizembe, naho neiitike, vizembe navo nevibanike. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Mna divai mp'hya yaungigwa kugeligwa mwe vizembe vihya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Naho hahali mnt'hu akuunga kunywa idivai mp'hya ananywa idya ya kale. Kwaviya naagambe, ‘Divai ya kale niyo iyedi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Dizuwa dyo Kulumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Mwe dizuwa dimwenga dyo Kuhumula, Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe wandaga wakaita kombokela mwe migunda ya uhemba. Niyo awanamp'hina wakwe wakonga kukwanyula vikole vo uhemba, naho nawakauhugusa no kuvidya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafalisayo wamwenga niyo wauza, “Nii nyuwe mwadamanya kint'hu kilemezwe kudamanywa mwe dizuwa dyo Kuhumula?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Ivi hamsomile kiya adamanyaga Daudi na weyawe umwo andaga na sala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Yehe engilaga mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, niyo aguha mikate alavilwe Mnungu, kaidya no kuwenk'ha weyawe. Naho Sigilizi zawafingiza want'hu watuhu kuidya imikate iyo, mna ni walava nt'hambiko du.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Niyo Yesu awagamba, “Mwana Mnt'hu niye Zumbe we dizuwa dyo Kuhumula.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu mta mkono uholomp'hale</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Mwe dizuwa dituhu dyo Kuhumula, Yesu agendaga kuhiniza kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu. Mna mwe idya nyumba mwandaga na mnt'hu aholole mkono wa kulume. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Wahinizi we miko hamwenga na Mafalisayo watuhu nawanda wazungula mzungu wo kumgwiila Yesu. Niyo wakaula uneva naamhonye yudya mnyonge mwe dizuwa dyo Kuhumula. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Mna Yesu niyo abunk'hula ivo wakufanyanya, niyo amgamba yudya mta mkono uholole, “Inuka ukimale hagati.” Yudya mnt'hu niyo enuka na kukimala hagati. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Niyo Yesu awagamba, “Nawauzani nyuwe, ivi miko yetu yakigamba suwe kidamanyei mwe dizuwa dyo Kuhumula? Kudamanya mbuli zedi hegu mbuli ziihiye? Kuhonya ugima wa mnt'hu hegu kuukoma?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ahitukaga nt'hendelo zose akawakaula, niyo amgamba yudya mnt'hu mta mkono uholole, “Chulula mkono wako.” Yudya mnt'hu niyo atenda enga ivo agambilwe, mkono wakwe niyo wanda mgima naho. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Wose niyo wafa maya, nakufanyanya woho kwa woho kugamba wamtendei Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awasagula Wegala ulosi mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Mwa mazuwa yadya, Yesu niyo ahalawa no kuita kwo lugulu, uko amlombezaga Mnungu kilo kigima. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Mtondo mwe dizuwa ditimile, Yesu ewetangaga wanamp'hina wakwe. Niyo asagula mlongo na waidi mwa awo no kuwetanga wegala ulosi <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simoni uyo enk'higwe zina dya Petulo ni Yesu na Anduleya nduguye na Yakobo na Yohana hamwenga na Filipo na Batolomayo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayo na Tomasi na Yakobo mwana Alufayo na Simoni akwitangwa Zelote, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda mwana wa Yakobo na Yuda Isikaliyote, uyo amsezenge Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahiniza no kuwahonya want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesu eze aseele kulawa kwo mnima na wegala ulosi wakwe, akimalaga hant'hu hatindimale. Fyo kulu dya wanamp'hina wakwe dyandaga aaho. Naho handaga na want'hu wengi kulawa Uyahudi na Yelusalemu ne mizi ya mp'wani ya Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Want'hu awo wezaga kumtegeleza Yesu hamwenga na kuhonywa maine yawe. Hata wadya wandile wakasulumizwa ni zimp'hepo, wezaga niyo wahonywa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Want'hu wose waungisaga wamdose Yesu kwaviya ludole nolukafosa mwakwe niyo lwawahonya want'hu wose.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinyemi na ligito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu awakaulaga wanamp'hina wakwe niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mna kinyemi nyuwe awakiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">kwaviya Useuta wa Mnungu ni wenyu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mvikilwa nyuwe mne sala ivi haluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwaviya nomwigute!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mvikilwa mkuila ivi haluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">kwaviya nomseke!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Mvikilwa uneva want'hu wana waihiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">no kuwalemelani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:22">no kuwahomolani no kuwa onani kugamba mwiwasavu, mna kwa mbuli ya Mwana wa Mnt'hu!<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Indeni na kinyemi na kwanga uneva ayo yakalaila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:23">kwaviya nt'hunyo ni nk'hulu kwe mbingu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:23">Kwaviya wakale wawe nivo wawatendaga walotezi wawalongoeleni nyuwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Mna hangi nyuwe wenye wagoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">kwaviya mpata kale wikazi wedi!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Hangi nyuwe wenye nyuwe mwigute ivi haluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwaviya nomwize mnde na sala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Hangi nyuwe wenye mkuseka ivi haluse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">kwaviya nomwize muile hamwenga na kuhongeza!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye uneva mnatogolwa ni want'hu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">Kwaviya wakale wawe nivo wawatendelaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">walotezi wo udant'hi.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwaunga wank'hondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Mna nyuwe mkunitegeleza nawagambani, waungeni wadya wank'hondo wenyu, wadamanyileni yedi wose wakuwatendelani yaihile. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Wavikileni wakuwaligitani, naho walombezeleni yedi kwa Mnungu wadya wakuwaihiyani. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Uneva mnt'hu anakutowa funda imwenga, mleke akutowe na ya kaidi. Naho uneva mnt'hu akukuhoka koti dyako, mwink'he ne nk'hazu nayo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mwink'he yeyose akukulombeza, naho uneva mnt'hu anakuhoka kint'hu chako usekuunga akuvuzile. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Watendeleni want'hu watuhu enga viya nyuwe mkuunga want'hu wawatendeleni.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Uneva mnawaunga want'hu wadya wakuwaungani, ivi mwalagisa uwedi wani? Kwaviya hata wata wavu wawaunga wadya wakuwaunga! <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Naho uneva mnadamanya mbuli zedi kwa wadya wakuwadamanyizila mbuli zedi du, ivi mwalagisa uwedi wani? Hata wata uwavu watenda iivo! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Naho uneva mnawenk'ha wadya mkumanya wadaha kuwaliha, ivi mwalagisa uwedi wani? Kwaviya hata wata uwavu wadamanya iivo, wakakawiila kuvuzilwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Mna waungeni wadya wakuwaihia na wadamanyileni mbuli zedi, wakopesheni want'hu naho msekukawiila kuvuzilwa. Niho nt'hunyo yenyu neinde nk'hulu, nanywe nomnde wana wa Mnungu e Kulanga vitendese. Kwaviya yehe ni ywedi kwa heweena nt'hogola na waihi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Naho indeni na mbazi, enga viya eli Tati yenyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwasengela watuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Msekuwasengela want'hu watuhu, Mnungu naye haawasengeleni nyuwe. Msekuwalonga wamwenga vihile, Mnungu naye hawalongileni vihile. Walekeleni wadya wawatendeleni yaihile, nanywe nomlekelwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Wenk'heni want'hu vint'hu, Mnungu naye naamwink'heni nyuwe. Nomhokele kihimo kimemile na kusint'hwa na kusegeswa kikuta kwitika, nicho Mnungu naakiike mwe mikono yenyu. Kwaviya kihimo kiya ukuwahimila watuhu, nicho Mnungu naawahimileni.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu niyo awagambila mliganyizo, “Mant'hunt'hu hakudaha kumlongoza mant'hunt'hu miyawe. Uneva anatenda ivo, nawaingile wose mwe dibome. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Mwanamp'hina hakudaha kumjink'ha mhinizi ywakwe. Mna kila mwanamp'hina akabinda mahinizo yakwe, adaha kuligana na mhinizi ywakwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Nii wakaula putiputi mwe diziso dya nduguyo mna weye una basi mwe diziso dyako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Hegu, noudahe vivihi kumgamba nduguyo, ‘Ndugu yangu, goja huuse putiputi mwe diziso dyako,’ mna hukudiona dibasi di mwe diziso dyako? Weye mtondwe! Konga kuusa idibasi di mwe diziso dyako, niho noudahe kukausa kaputiputi mwe diziso dya nduguyo.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mti wamanyika kwa cheleko chakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Hahana mti wedi ukudaha kunda na cheleko kiihile, naho hahana mti wiihile ukudaha kunda na cheleko chedi. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Kwaviya kila mti wamanyika kwa cheleko chakwe. Want'hu hawakudaha kwaha tini kulawa mwe miwa, naho hawakudaha kwaha zabibu mwe miwambangoma. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Mnt'hu ywedi alava yadya ayedi kulawa mwe kindolo chakwe chedi cho umoyo wakwe, mna mnt'hu mwavu alava yadya yaihile kulawa mwe kindolo chakwe kiihile cho moyo wakwe. Kwaviya mnt'hu alonga yadya yamemile mwo moyo wakwe.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wazesi waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Naho nii mwanitanga ‘Zumbe, Zumbe,’ mna hamkudamanya yadya hulonga? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Mnt'hu yoyose akwiza kwangu na kwiva ulosi wangu na kuudamanya <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />uyo naande enga mnt'hu azengile nyumba, naho nk'hongelo yakwe kaizenga moluwe. Fula nk'hulu ize inye, mazi mengi yaitowa idya inyumba, mna haigwele kwaviya izengigwa vedi. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Mna mnt'hu yoyose akwiva zimbuli zangu mna hanatendile ivo zikumuunga, uyo naande enga mnt'hu azengile nyumba yakwe mwo msanga haheina nk'hongelo. Fula nk'hulu ize inye, mazi niyo yaitowa, yaisingisa no kuikinya, niyo yabanikisa!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mwana ywa mkulu yumwenga wa watowani wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu eze ajike kulonga zimbuli izo kwa want'hu, niyo ahalawa na kuita Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mtumwa ywa mkulu yumwenga ywa watowani wa Kilumi andilisaga mnyonge. Naho mkulu uyo naakamuungisa.<figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Mkulu ywa watowani wa Loma</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Mkulu uyo eze eve zimbuli za Yesu, niyo asigiila wadala vilongozi wamwenga wa Kiyahudi kwa Yesu wamlombeze vileke eze amhonye mtumwa ywakwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Nawo weze wabule kwa Yesu, wamweilisa wakamgamba, “Mnt'hu uyu kawagilwa umtendele imbuli ino <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />kwaviya nakawaungisa want'hu, naho kakizengela Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ivo Yesu niyo aita hamwenga nawo. Hata eze ande e haguhi ne kaya ya yudya mkulu wawa watowani, niyo yudya mkulu ywa watowani asigiila mnt'hu kwakwe akamgamba, “Zumbe, usekwangadika kwiza kwangu, kwaviya miye hina wedi ukukutenda weye wingile kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />naho miye name hina wedi wakunitenda kwiza kwako. Mna longa mbuli du, mtumwa ywangu naahone. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Kwaviya miye name ni mnt'hu mta udahi, naho nnanawo watowani we hasi yangu. Hamgamba yumwenga, ‘Ita!’ Naye aita, naho hamgamba mtuhu, ‘So!’ Eza, naho hamgamba mtumwa ywangu, ‘Damanya ivi!’ Adamanya.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu eze eve ayo, niyo ehelwa, niyo awahitukila want'hu wandile wakamtimila no kuwagamba, “Nawagambilani, hinati nione mnt'hu mta mhuwi enga uno mwe isi ya Izilaeli!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Naho wadya want'hu watumigwe weze wauye kaya kwa yudya mkulu wawa watowani, niyo wambwiila yudya mtumwa mnyonge kahona.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amuuyula mwana kilume wa mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Eze ajike aho, niyo Yesu hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe waita kwo mzi ukwitangwa Naini. Fyo kulu dya want'hu niyo dyawatimila. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Weze wabule he nk'hili yo mzi, waduganaga na want'hu wenule mnt'hu abanike, wagenda kumosa msanga. Mbwanga uyo abanike andaga mwana ikedu ywa mvele yumwenga andile kabanikilwa ni mgosiwe, naho want'hu wengi wo mzi uwo nawanda hamwenga naye. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Zumbe eze amuone yudya mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe, niyo amwonela mbazi, niyo amgamba, “Usekuila.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Niyo asogela no kudidosa dijeneza, wadya wadinule niyo wakimala. Yesu niyo agamba, “Mbwanga, nakugamba, inuka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Yudya mbwanga niyo enuka no kwikala, niyo akonga kulonga. Yesu niyo amwink'hiza kwa nine.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Want'hu wose niyo wengilwa ni wogofi, niyo wakonga kumtogola Mnungu no kugamba, “Mlotezi mkulu keza kwetu, naho Mnungu kawakombola want'hu wakwe!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Niyo mbuli za Yesu zagendezwa mwe isi yose ya Uyahudi na mwe ziisi za hagihi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wegala mbuli kulawa kwa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Wanamp'hina wa Yohana niyo wamgambila Yohana zimbuli izo zose. Yohana niyo awetanga waidi wawe, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />niyo awasigila kwa Zumbe vileke wakamuuze kugamba, “Ivi weye ni yudya Yohana agambile neeze, hegu kimgojele mtuhu?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Weze wabule kwa Yesu, niyo wamgamba, “Yohana Mbatizi kakituma kwako kikuuze kugamba, weye ni yudya akwiza, hegu kikawiile mtuhu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Umwo wandaga wakamuuza, Yesu nakahonya want'hu wengi wandile wanyonge na wata masungusungu no kulava mp'hepo ziihile, naho awatendaga mant'hunt'hu wengi wadahe kuwona. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Niyo Yesu awahitula wanamp'hina wa Yohana kugamba, “Iteni mkamgambile Yohana yadya muyaone na kuyeva, mant'hunt'hu waona, viwete wagenda, wata matana wakukizwa, wata magutwi heyekwiva weva, wabanike wauyuka, na wakiwa wabilikizwa Mbuli Yedi. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Wavikilwa want'hu wadya heihizwe kwa yadya huyadamanya!”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Wadya want'hu watumigwe ni Yohana weze wahalawe, niyo Yesu akonga kuwagambila want'hu mbuli za Yohana. “Mwize mwiite kwe nyika, ivi nomgenda kukaulai? Kukaula kanyazi kakusingiswa ni mp'heho? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ivi nomgenda kukaulai? Mnt'hu availe suke zedi? Manyeni kugamba want'hu wavaile suke zedi na want'hu wana wikazi wedi weyuko kwe mazumba ye kiseuta! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Mna nigambileni, ivi nomgenda kukaulai? Mlotezi? Heiye, naho eli mkulu kujink'ha mlotezi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Kwaviya Yohana niye awandikilwe mwa Mawandiko Yakukile kugamba, ‘Mnungu agamba, kaula namtuma mwigala mbuli ywangu akulongowele, uyo naakwikile lumwe sila yako.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu niyo agamba, nawagambilani,” “Hahali mkulu kumjink'ha Yahana mwe want'hu wose we isi ino. Mna mnt'hu yoyose mdodo kujink'ha wose mwo Useuta wa Mnungu, uyo ni mkulu kumjink'ha Yohana.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Want'hu wose, hata waduganya kodi weze weve ayo, wamzumilaga uwedi wa Mnungu kwaviya nawabatizwa ubatizo wa Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Mna Mafalisayo na wahinizi we zimiko nawalemela kumzumila Mnungu kwaviya hawabatizwe ni Yohana.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Ivi niwaliganye na kint'hu chani want'hu we cheleko iki? Ivi want'hu awa waligana na mbwai? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Waligana na wana wekale kwe digwilo. Fyo dimwenga dikwitangana na tuhu kugamba, ‘Nakiwatoela mluli mna hamvinile, naho nekiwakemela wila wa kuhongeza mna hamwiile!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yohana Mbatizi nakeza, hakudya nk'hande naho hakunywa divai, nanywe niyo mwagamba, ‘Ana mp'hepo!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana Mnt'hu keza, akadya no kunywa, nanywe niyo mwagamba, ‘Mkauleni mnt'hu uyu, mhank'hu naho mkozi. Wambuyaze ni waduganya kodi na wata wavu!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Mna mzungu wa Mnungu uoneka kunda kindedi kwa want'hu wose wakuuzumila.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwe nyumba ya Simoni Mfalisayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mnt'hu yumwenga Mfalisayo niyo amlalika Yesu kaya kwakwe akadye nk'hande ya kilo. Yesu niyo aita kwe nyumba ya yudya Mfalisayo no kwikala vileke adye. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mwo mzi udya, kwandaga na mvele yumwenga mta wavu. Niyo eva kugamba Yesu adya nk'hande mwe nyumba ya yudya Mfalisayo. Niyo eza na kashupa kandaga na mavuta yana mhemp'he. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Niyo akimala kunyuma, hagihi ne iviga va Yesu, niyo aila masozi yakwe yatomokela mwe viga va Yesu. Akajika mvele yudya avihangusa iviga va Yesu kwafili zakwe na kuvinonela hamwenga na kuvihaka mavuta ya mhemp'he. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Yudya Mfalisayo amlalike Yesu eze aone viya, niyo alonga mwo umoyo wakwe, “Mnt'hu uyu uneva andile mlotezi, nakamanya mvele uyu akumdosa kugamba ni mnt'hu ywa vivihi, hegu nakamanya kugamba ni mta uwavu!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu niyo amhitula yudya Mfalisayo na kugamba, “Simoni, iyuko mbuli huunga hugambile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni niyo agamba, “Heiye, longa Mhinizi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Niyo Yesu amgamba, “Kwandaga na want'hu waidi wakopaga matundu kwa mnt'hu akukopesha. Yumwenga akopaga dinali magana mashano na wakaidi akopaga dinali milongo mishano. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Wose waidi niyo hawana cho kuliha, ivo mnt'hu yudya awakopeshe niyo awalekela wose. Ivi mwe awo waidi, ni yuhi akuunga amuungise yudya mnt'hu awakopeshe?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni niyo amhitula, “Naona ni yudya alekelwe ase kuliha matundu mengi”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kulonga vedi.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yesu niyo amhitukila yudya mvele na kumgamba Simoni, “Kumuwona uyu mvele? Hingila kwako, mna hunink'hile mazi ya kuhaka viga vangu, mna uyu kasunt'ha iviga vangu kwa masozi yakwe hamwenga na kuvihangusa ne zifili zakwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Weye huninonele, mna mvele uyu kukongela ivo ningile halekile kuvinonela iviga vangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Hunihakile mavuta mwo mtwi wangu, mna uyu kanihaka iviga vangu mavuta ya mhemp'he. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Nakugambila, kwaviya uwavu wakwe mwingi uusigwa, ivo yehe naye kaungisa. Mna mnt'hu akuusilwa uwavu mgeke, yehe naye aunga ludogo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yesu niyo amgamba yudya mvele, “Uwavu wako uusigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Want'hu wamwenga wandile hadya niyo wakonga kulonga mwe imioyo yawe, “Mnt'hu uyu ni mnt'hu ywani hata auwausile want'hu wavu?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Mna Yesu niyo amgamba yudya mvele, “Mhuwi wako ukuyokola. Keitile kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Wavele wamtuma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Yeze yajike ayo, Yesu naakazungulukila mwe mizi na mwe zikaya, akabilikiza Mbuli Yedi yo Useuta wa Mnungu. Wadya wanamp'hina mlongo na waidi wandile nae, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />hamwenga na wavele wamwenga walavigwe mp'hepo na kuhonyigwa maine yawe. Wavele awo wandaga ni Maliamu akwitangwa Magedalena alavigwe mp'heho mfungate, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />na Yoana mkaza Kuza andile mkulu mwe kitala cha Helode, na Susana na wavele watuhu wengi wandile wakamsank'hanila Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe kwa vint'hu vawe.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo mhandi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Want'hu wengi wandaga wakamwizila Yesu kulawa kila mzi. Fyo kulu dya want'hu dize didugane hamwenga, Yesu alongaga nawo kwa mliganyizo uno.<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mhandi agendaga kuhanda mbeyu. Umwo akazimyaga, zimwenga zagweelaga mwe sila, niyo zajatangizwa, wadege niyo wazidya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Zimwenga zagweelaga mwo luwe, zize zikonge kuhota, niyo zahomp'hala kwa kuswesa uwolo. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Zimwenga zagweelaga mgati mwe miwa, imiwa niyo yakula hamwenga nazo, niyo yazivigaviga. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Zimwenga zagweelaga mwo ulongo wedi. Zakulaga no kweleka, kila imwenga malavo gana.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilekile akahiniza kwa miliganyizo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wa muuza Yesu, “Mliganyizo uwo nivo wagaaze?” <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe hiwagambilani mbuli zo Useuta wa Mnungu. Mna kwa want'hu watuhu nalonga kwa miliganyizo, vileke</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">wakakaula wase kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">wakategeleza, wase kukombaganya.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awatambalisa umliganyizo wo mhandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Uno nuwo ulosi wo mliganyizo uno, mbeyu, ni Imbuli ya Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Mbeyu ziya zigweele mwe sila zaliganywa na want'hu wakuiva Imbuli ya Mnungu, mna Mwavu eza kuiusa mwe mioyo yawe vileke wanase kuhuwila no kuyokolwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mbeyu zigweele mwo luwe, zaliganyizwa na want'hu wakuiva imbuli ya Mnungu, niyo waihokela kwa kinyemi, mna haikuika maizi kwaviya waswesa ulongo. Wahuwila ludodo du, wakagezigwa nu Mwavu, wadunduga no kuuleka mhuwi wawe. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Mbeyu zigweele he miwa zaliganyizwa na want'hu wakuiva imbuli ya Mnungu, mna wakagendeela, mbuli iyo yavigwavigwa ni wogofi wo wikazi uno, no ugoli no kuungisa vint'hu ve isi. Want'hu awa hawakwelela chochose. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Mbeyu zigwele mwo ulongo wedi zaliganyizwa na want'hu wakuiva Imbuli ya Mnungu, niyo waihokela na kuihuwila mwe mioyo yawe, naho wafinyiliza mpaka weleke matunda.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lugubikwe ni kihungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Hakuli mnt'hu akukweleza lumuli no kulugubika ne kihungu hegu kulwiika kwe divungu, mna alwiika henukile vileke kila akwingila auone ung'azi wakwe.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Kwaviya kila mbuli igubikwe neigubulwe, naho ifisigwe, neilaile kung'aile.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Elo indeni na wengele kwa ayo mkuyeva, kwaviya kila mta kint'hu noongezelwe, mna mnt'hu heina kint'hu naahokigwe hata kiya kidodo akufanyanywa kunda nacho.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nine na wanduguze dya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Nine na wanduguze dya Yesu niyo wambasa, mna hawadahile kumsogeela hagihi kwaviya fyo dya want'hu nedindilisa kulu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Mnt'hu yumwenga niyo amgamba Yesu, “Nyokwe na wanduguzo we kuse, waunga wakuone.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu niyo awagamba want'hu wose, “Mnala na wandugu zangu ni wadya wakuiva Mbuli ya Mnungu no kuihuwila.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu autivila mjubwaniso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwelaga mwe ngalawa. Niyo awagamba, “Nekijink'hanyeni int'hendelo int'huhu ye diziwa.” Ivo niyo wakonga kuita. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Weze wakonge kuita, Yesu niyo agona nt'hongo. Aaho, nk'hung'unt'ho nk'hulu yakongaga kuvumila mwe bahali, ngalawa niyo yakonga kumema mazi, niyo wanda hagihi no kwangamila.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Wana mp'hina wamwinulaga, wakamgamba, “Zumbe, Zumbe! Chabanika pele!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu niyo enuka, niyo aitivila ink'hung'unt'ho idya hamwenga na mazi ye diziwa, niyo kwanda mp'heho tondolo. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Niyo Yesu awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Wikuhi mhuwi wenyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Weheelagwa na kogoha, wakagambana, “Uyu ni mnt'hu ywa vivihi? Akutivila nk'hung'unt'ho ne mijubwaniso ye bahali, navo vamwiva!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mnt'hu mta mp'hepo zihile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wagendeela ne nt'hambo, niyo wabula mwe isi ya Wagelasi imwe nt'hendelo nt'huhu ye bahali ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu eze afose mwe ingalawa, aduganaga na mt'hu yumwenga wo mzi uwo mta mp'hepo. Mnt'hu uyo andaga kimbwigili mazuwa mengi, naho haakekala kwe kaya mna yehe naakekala kwe vikuta. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Eze amuone Yesu, niyo aila kwa izwi kulu, niyo amgweela Yesu he viga na kuguta, akagamba, “Yesu, Mwana Mnungu e kulanga! Togola, waunga unitende vivihi? Nakeiila kwako, use kunisulumiza!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Yudya mnt'hu nakalonga ivo kwaviya Yesu nakamgamba yudya mp'hepo amlawe. Nk'hanana nyingi mp'hepo yudya naakamwizila. Naho hamwenga mnt'hu uyo naakata kwamilwa kwa kuvugailwa kwe divugailo no kukakigwa mp'hingu na kwe viga ne mikono, mna naakadaha kuzikant'ha zimp'hingu akakilizwe nazo, niyo mp'hepo zamwigala kwe nyika.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu amuuzaga, “Weye wetangwa ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Niyo ahitula, “Netangwa Fyo.” Ahitulaga ivo kwaviya andaga na mp'hepo waihile wabindile ingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Niyo mp'hepo wadya wakeiila kwa Yesu asekuwagulusila kwe isi ya want'hu wabanike.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Hagihi na hadya handaga na fyo kulu dya nguluwe dyandaga dikadima mwe diwandamo dyo mnima. Niyo mp'hepo wadya wakweiila kwa Yesu vileke wakengile mwe difyo idyo. Yesu niyo awazumila. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Niyo wadya mp'hepo wamlawa yudya mnt'hu no kwingila mwe difyo idyo. Difyo nadyo niyo dyagulukisa kuhinga kwe bahali, niyo dyanywa nk'habu.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Wadimi wa nguluwe weze waone diya dilaile, niyo wanyilika no kugendeza kose imbuli mwo mzi na mwe migunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Want'hu niyo wagenda kukaula diya dilaile. Weze wabule kwa Yesu, niyo wamuona yudya mnt'hu alavigwe mp'hepo kekala he viga va Yesu, kavala suke zakwe, naho ana ubala ukint'hile. Wose niyo wogohesa. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Wadya wayaone ayo niyo wawatambalisa weyawe ivo yudya mnt'hu andile na mp'hepo waihile ahonyigwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Niyo want'hu wose we isi ya Wagelasi wamnombezaga ahalawe mwe isi yawe kwaviya nawengilwa ni wogofi. Ivo Yesu engilaga mwe ngalawa no kuhalawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Yudya mnt'hu alavigwe mp'hepo waihile, amlombezaga Yesu kugamba waitanye, mna Yesu niyo amsigiila, akamgamba, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Uya kaya ukawagambile want'hu ivo Mnungu akutendele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Yudya mnt'hu niyo aita kila hant'hu, akawagambila ivo Yesu amdamanyile.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana ywa kike ywa Yailo na mvele adosile suke ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu eze auye kwe nt'hendelo nt'huhu ye diziwa, want'hu wamhokelaga kwa kinyemi, kwaviya wose wandaga wakamgoja. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Niyo eza mnt'hu yumwenga akwitangwa Yailo, naye ni mkulu we nyumba yo kuvikila. Eze ambwiile Yesu, amgweela mwe viga, akeiila kwa Yesu waitanye kwakwe <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />kwaviya mwanawe ywa kike heendile na miyawe naakatoweela. Mwana uyo andile na myaka mlongo na miidi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Umwo Yesu andile akaita, want'hu nawakamgela lugovyagovya nt'hendelo zose. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mwa awo want'hu, andaga umwo mvele yumwenga andaga na unyonge wa kulawigwa ni sakame kwa malavo mlongo na miidi. Mvele uyo azaga vint'hu vingi kwa kuwenk'ha walaguzi, mna hakwandile na yoyose adahile kumhonya. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Niyo amwiziila Yesu kwa kumtimila kunyuma, niyo adosa imp'hindilo ye suke ya Yesu. Aaho, niyo isakame yaleka kumlawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu niyo auza, “Ni ani anidosile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Want'hu wose weze wakane, Petulo niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, fyo dikuzunguluka na kukuvigaviga!”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Mna Yesu niyo agamba, “Eyuko mnt'hu anidosile. Hibunk'hula ivo kwaviya hiona ludole lukanilawa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Yudya mvele eze aone hakudaha kukekifisa, niyo amwiziila Yesu akazingiza, niyo akeduula heviga va Yesu. Ahadya mwekiyeti cha want'hu amgambilaga Yesu kiya chamtendile akamdosa, na ivo ahonile aaho eze amdose. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu niyo amgamba yudya mvele, “Mwanangu, mhuwi wako ukuhonya, ita na utondowazi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Umwo Yesu andile akalonga ayo, ezaga mnt'hu kulawa kwe kaya ya Yailo. Niyo amgamba Yailo, “Use kumgela lugovyagovya Mhinizi. Mwanao kabanika kale.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Mna Yesu eze eve ayo, niyo amgamba Yailo, “Use kogoha, weye huwila du, mwanao naa hone.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Eze abule kwe kaya ya Yailo, hazumile mnt'hu yoyose engile naye kwe nyumba, ila Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo, hamwenga na ise na nine dya yudya mwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Want'hu wose nawanda wakaila no kuhongeza ifile ya yudya mwana. Yesu niyo awagamba, “Msekuila, mwana habanike, kagona du!”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Want'hu niyo wamsekesa kwaviya nawamanya kugamba mwana yudya kabanika kale. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Mna Yesu niyo amtoza mkono niyo amgamba, “Mwanangu, inuka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ugima wakwe niyo wamuuiya, aaho niyo enuka. Yesu niyo awagamba wamwink'he nk'hande. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Welesi wakwe niyo weheleswa, mna Yesu niyo awafingiza wasekumgambila mnt'hu yoyose diya dilaile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awasigiila wanamp'hina mlongo na waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu niyo awetanga wadya mlongo na waidi, awenk'haga ludole na udahi wa kulava mp'hepo wose waihile na kuhonya maine. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Niyo awasigiila waite kokubilikiza mbuli yo Useuta wa Mnungu hamwenga na kuhonya wanyonge, <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />akawagamba, “Msekuguha kint'hu mwe nt'hambo yenyu. Msekuguha nk'home, hegu nk'hoba, hegu nk'hande, hegu matundu, naho msekuguha hata nk'hazu mbili. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Nyumba yoyose mkwingila niyo mwetikilwa, ikaleni umwo mpaka mhalawe mwo mzi uwo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Want'hu wanalemela kuwahokela, foseni mwo mzi uwo, naho mkafosa kung'unt'heni luvumbi mwe viga venyu inde uwona kugamba wawalemelani.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Niyo wasambala wakazunguluka mwe zikaya zose wakabilikiza Mbuli Yedi hamwenga na kuhonya want'hu kila hant'hu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zumbe Helode kengilwa ni wogofi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Zumbe Helode niyo eva zimbuli zose zilaile, niyo engilwa ni wogofi kwaviya want'hu wamwenga nawakagamba Yohana Mbatizi kauyuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Wamwenga nawo nawakagamba Eliya kalaila, watuhu nawo nawakagamba yumwenga mwa walotezi wa kale kauyuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Mna Helode niyo agamba, “Yohana nehimkant'ha umtwi. Haluse uyu naye ni ani hwiva zimbuli zakwe?” Niyo aunga kumuwona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awenk'ha nk'hande want'hu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Wadya wegala ulosi weze wauye, niyo wamgambila Yesu mbuli zose zidamanyike uko. Yesu niyo awaguha no kuita mpaka kwo mzi ukwitangwa Betisaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Fyo dya want'hu dize dive, niyo dyambasa, Yesu naye awahokelaga niyo alonga nawo mbuli zo Useuta wa Mnungu na kuwahoya want'hu waungile kuhonywa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Kwize kunde kisingi, wadya wanamp'hina wakwe mlongo na waidi niyo wambasa na kumgamba, “Walage want'hu waite mwe zikaya ne zink'honde zimgihi vileke wakazungule nk'hande hamwenga na hant'hu ha kugona kwaviya aha ni he nyika.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Wenk'heni nyuwe nk'hande.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Niyo woho wamhitula, “Hakina kint'hu ila mikate mishano na samaki mbili du. Haluse waunga suwe kiite kikagule nk'hande kwa fyo dyose idi?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Wagosi du awo wandaga aaho wabulaga magana milongo mishano. Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe wawekazeni want'hu hasi mwe vibunga vya want'hu milongo mishano shano.<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Wanap'hina weze wajike kuwekaza, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu niyo aguha idya mikate mishano ne zisamaki ziya zimbuli. Niyo akaula kulanga kwe mbingu no kumtogola Mnungu kwa ivo, avibendula no kuwenk'ha awanamp'hina wakwe wawapangile want'hu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Want'hu wose niyo wadya no kwiguta, naho niyo waduganya wabesu wasigale wakubula nt'hangulu mlongo na mbili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amtambula Yesu kunda ni Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Zuwa dimwenga, Yesu akanda mwenye ekedu andaga mwo kulombeza Mnungu. Wanamp'hina wakwe nawamwiitila, yehe niyo awauza, “Ivi want'hu wanigamba miye ni miye ani?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Niyo wamhitula, “Wamwenga wagamba weye niye Yohana Mbatizi, wamwenga wagamba niwe Eliya na watuhu nao wagamba weye u yumwenga mwe walotezi wa kale wauyuke wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Nyuwe nanywe mwanigamba miye ni miye ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petulo niyo amhitula, “Weye niwe Kilisito ulaile kwa Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimuila mbuli ya masulumizo ne file yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:3-9:1">Maliko 8:3-9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Mna Yesu niyo awafingiza wasekumgambila mnt'hu yoyose mbuli idya. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Niyo agendeela kugamba, “Mwana ywa Mnt'hu naapatise masulumizo, naho naalemelwe ni wadala vilongozi na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wahinizi we Zisigilizi. Naho naakomigwe, mna zuwa dya katatu kukongela hadya akomigwe naauyuke.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Niyo awagamba want'hu wose, “Mnt'hu yoyose akuunga kunibasa, yaungwa akekane ye mwenye, enule msalaba wakwe kila zuwa, niyo eza kwangu. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kwaviya mnt'hu akuunga kuukombola ugima wakwe nawazaganye, mna yoyose akuunga awazaganye ugima wakwe kwa kunizungula miye naa uyokole. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ivi mnt'hu anapata kila kint'hu mwe isi yose, mna anawazaganya ugima wakwe, mnt'hu uyo naapatei? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Uneva mnt'hu ananionele soni miye hamwenga na mbuli zangu, Mwana ywa Mnt'hu naye naamuwonele soni mnt'hu uyo akezakwiza mwo wedi wakwe utendese na wa Ise na watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wakukile. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nawagambilani kindedi, weyuko watuhu aha hawabanike mpaka aho nawauone Useuta wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahituka ifuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mnane kukongela hadya eze alonge ayo, niyo awaguha Petulo na Yohana na Yakobo niyo akwela nawo kwo lugulu vileke akalombeze Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Umwo andile mwo kulombeza, futa yakwe yahitukaga, zisuke zakwe nazo zandaga na ung'azi wa kumwekamweka. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ahadya want'hu waidi wandaga want'hu waidi wandaga wakasimuila hamwenga na yehe. Want'hu awo wandaga ni Musa na Eliya <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />waonekaga mwo uwedi utendese wa kwe mbingu wakalonga na Yesu ivo naakaungwa kubindiliza yadya aungile Mnungu, kwa yehe kubanika kukuunga kulaile Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Petulo hamwenga na weyawe wandaga wagona nt'hongo. Weze wenuke, niyo wauona uwedi utendese wa Yesu na wadya want'hu waidi wakimale hamwenga naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Wadya want'hu weze wamwase Yesu, Petulo niyo amuuza, “Zumbe, kaula ivo vili vedi suwe kinde aha! Nekidamanye viheha vitatu, kamwenga kako, katuhu ka Musa na katuhu ka Eliya.” Petulo hamanyaga yadya naakalonga.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Umwo Petulo andile akalonga, niyo halaila vunde dyagubikaga, woho niyo wogohesa umwo weze wagubikwe ni diya divunde. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Izwi niyo dyevika kulawa kwe mbingu dikagamba, “Uyu niye Mwanangu nimsagule, mtegelezeni yehe!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Izwi idyo dize divike, Yesu niyo aoneka ekedu. Wanamp'hina niyo wanyamala, hawamgambile mnt'hu yoyose zimbuli ziya wazione.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mbwanga mta mp'hepo waihile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maliko 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Zuwa ditimile, Yesu hamwenga na wadya wanap'hina watatu waseelaga kulawa kudya kwo lugulu. Fyo kulu dya want'hu niyo dyadugana na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Mnt'hu yumwenga mwe difyo diya niyo agutila, “Mhinizi! Nakulombeza mkaule mwanangu, mwanangu nuuyo du! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Nkanana nyingi mp'hepo aihile akamwizila, amtenda agutile, naho amgela kifutu na kulawa fulo. Hakumlekela mpaka amlumizise, niho amlekela. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nehiwalombeza wanamp'hina wako wamlave, mna wadunduga.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe cheleko hekikuhuwila, chagile! Nenikale na nyuwe na kugigimiza mpaka ini?” Niyo amgamba yudya mnt'hu, “Mlete mwanao aha.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Umwo yudya mbwanga andile akegalwa kwa Yesu, mp'hepo aihile niyo amkinya hasi na kumgela kifutu. Yesu niyo amtivila yudya mp'hepo, niyo amhonya yudya mbwanga na kumvuza kwa ise. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Want'hu wose niyo wehelwa kwa udahi mkulu wa Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu alonga kaidi mbuli yo kubanika kwakwe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Umwo want'hu wandile wakehelwa kwe zimbuli naakadamanya Yesu, niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Msekujala kiya huwagambilani! Mwana ywa Mnt'hu agenda kugeligwa mwe mikono ya want'hu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Mna wanamp'hina hawaimanyaga imbuli idya kugamba yagaaze, kwaviya neifisigwa kwawe vileke wase kuikombaganya, naho nawakogoha kumuuza Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu ni ani?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Niyo wanamp'hina wa Yesu wakonga kuuzana kugamba ni ani akuunga ande mkulu mgati mwawe. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu nakamanya ivo wakufanyanya mwe mioyo yawe, niyo amguha mwana mdodo na kumkimalisa haguhi naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Niyo awagamba, “Mnt'hu yoyose akumhokela mwana enga uyu kwa ajili yangu, anihokela miye. Yudya naye akuunga anihokele miye, amhokela yudya akisigiile. Kwaviya e mdodo mwa nyuwe, niye mkulu kujink'ha wose.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu yoyose heekuhigana na nyuwe ni uyo ni mienyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maliko 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohana niyo amgamba Yesu, “Zumbe, nekimuwona mnt'hu akulava mp'hepo waihile kwa dizina dyako, niyo chamfingiza kwaviya hakutimilana na suwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu niyo amhitula Yohana, “Msekumfingiza, kwaviya mnt'hu yoyose heekuhigana na nyuwe e hamwenga na nyuwe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Samalia walemela kumzumila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Mazuwa ya Yesu yo kuguhigwa kulanga yeze yande hagihi mpaka, aungisaga kuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Awasigilaga want'hu wamlongoele, awo waitaga niyo wengila mwe kaya ya Wasamalia wakaike lumwe kila kint'hu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Mna wakaya wa Samaliya hawamhokele kwaviya wamanyaga kugamba andaga akaita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Wanamp'hina wakwe, Yakobo na Yohana weze waone ayo, niyo wagamba, “Zumbe, waunga kilagize moto usele kulawa kulanga uwakome pele wose?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu niyo awahitukila na kuwativila. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Niyo Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe waita kwe kaya nt'huhu.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wawagilwe kunda wanamp'hina wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Umwo wandile mwe sila, mnt'hu yumwenga niyo amgamba, “Nohutongele kokose kudya ukunga wiite!”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Mauzi yana mp'hanga, na wadege wa mwo ulanga nawo wana masasa, mna Mwana ywa Mnt'hu hana hant'hu ho kuke humuza.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesu niyo amgamba mnt'hu mtuhu, “Nitongele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Mna mnt'hu yudya niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, goja hande kummosa msanga tate.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Waleke want'hu wabanike wawamose msanga wabanike weyawe, mna weye ita ukabilikize Useuta wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Mnt'hu mtuhu niyo amgamba Yesu, “Zumbe, nohubase, mna goja hawalage wandugu zangu kaya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Mnt'hu yoyose anawaluka mna niyo akaula kunyuma, hakuzumilwa kwo Useuta wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu awatuma, wegala ulosiwatuhu milongo mfungate na waidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Yeze yajike ayo, Zumbe asagulaga watuhu milongo mfungate na waidi, no kuwatuma wamlongoele kwa kila mzi na kila kaya, kudya yemwenye akawiile kuita. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Niyo awagamba, “ulozo utenda mwingi, mna wavuni wageke. Mlombezeni Zumbe wo ulozo egale wavuni. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Iteni! Nawegalani enga ngoto mwe difyo dya mauzi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Msekuguha mfuko hegu nk'hoba hegu vilatu, naho mse kwikalisa mkalamsa want'hu mwe sila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Uneva mkengila he nyumba, walamseni mkagamba, ‘Utondowazi unde mwe nyumba ino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Uneva naande aaho awagilwe utondowazi, lekeni ndamsa yenyu ikale naye, mna uneva hahali, iguheni indamsa yenyu yo utondowazi. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Ikaleni mwe nyumba iiyo, dyeni, no kunywa vovose nomwink'higwe, kwaviya, wandima wawagilwa maliho. Msekusama sama kulawa nyumba ino, kuita nt'huhu. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Mneva mnaita kwo mzi niyo want'hu wakwe wanawahokelani, dyeni viya mkuunga mwiikilwe ho ludyo, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />honyeni wanyonge mwo mzi uwo, naho muwagambe want'hu wa aho, ‘Useuta wa Mnungu ubula hagihi na nyuwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Mna mnaita mwo mzi niyo hawa wahokeleni, halaweni aho, niyo mkabula kwe sila gambeni, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘No luvumbi lulawile mwo mzi wenyu, lung'ang'anile mwe viga vetu, chawakunk'hunt'hilani. Mna mmanye kugamba, Useuta wa Mnungu wiza hagihi na nyuwe!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nawagambilani kindedi kugamba, mwe di zuwa dyo usengelo Mnungu naawafiile mbazi Sodoma, kujink'ha umzi uwo.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mizi heiina mhuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayo 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Hangi we mwenye, Kolazini, hangi we mwenye Betisaida, kwaviya vihungi vidamanywe kwako vadamanywe Tilo na Sidoni, hegu wa keiilaga kale kwa Mnungu, wakavala suke za magunia, na kuhaka maivu. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mna kwe dizuwa dyo usengelo, Mnungu naalagise mbazi kwa Tilo na Sidoni kuwajink'ha nyuwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Weyawe Kapelinaumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 10:15">Noukekweze mpaka kulanga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 10:15">Bule, noukulumulwe mpaka hasi kwe isi ya wabanike!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Yeyose akuwategeleza nyuwe anitegeleza miye, na yudya akuwalemela nyuwe anilemela miye na yudya akunilemela miye amlemela yudya anigale.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwa wadya milongo mfungate na waidi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Niyo wadya milongo mfungate na waidi wauya kwa kinyemi kikulu wakagamba, “Zumbe, hata mp'hepo ziihile zikiva kwe dizina dyako.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nehimuwona Mwavu, akagwa enga lumwemwe kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Kauleni, hiwenk'ha udahi wa kujata nyoka na visuse hamwenga na kuluhuma ludole lwose lwo Mwavu, naho hakihali kint'hu kikuunga kiwanyulikeni. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Mna msekunda na kinyemi Kwaviya mp'hepo zimivani, mna indeni ne kinyemi Kwaviya amazina yenyu yawandikwa kwa Mnungu”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinyemi cha Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Mwo lupisi uludya Yesu angaga kwa udahi wa Muye ywa Mnungu akagamba, “Tate ywe Isi ne Mbigu, nakutogola kwaviya wata mizungu na wabala kuwafisa zimbuli izi, niyo wawalagisa wana wakembe heweina umanyi; Heiye Tate ivi nivo vikwelele vilaile.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tate kanink'ha vint'hu vose. Hahali ammanyize Mwana kwa kindedi, ila ni Tate mwenye ekedu, naho hahali ammanyize Tate kwa kindedi ila nu umwanawe du, na wadya wasagulwe nu umwana vileke wamanye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yesu niyo awahitukila wanamp'hina wakwe na kuwagamba, kwa kinyele, “Wavikilwa wadya wakuwona zimbuli izi mkuziona. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Namigambilani, walotezi hamwenga na mazumbe wengi nawakaunga kuyaona aya muyaone, mna hawayaone. Naho nawakaunga kwiva yadya mwivile mna hawadahile.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wo msamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Mhinizi we Miko na keza vileke amgeze Yesu, “Mhinizi, Nitendei vileke nihokele ugima wa mazuwa yose”?<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Mawandiko Ukukile yagaaze? Weye waukombaganya vivihi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo amhitula Yesu, “ ‘Muunge Zumbe Mnungu ywako, kwa moyo wako wose, na kwa ugima wako wose no udahi zako zose, no ubala wako wose’, naho ‘umuunge miyao enga viya ukukeunga weye mwenye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Kulonga kindedi. Damanya ayo naunde no ugima.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Mna vileke aketende ywedi, niyo amuuza Yesu, “Miyangu ni ani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Mnt'hu yumwenga naakasela kulawa Yelusalemu kuita Yeliko, Niyo want'hu waihile wamgwila no kumhambula zisuke, niyo wamtoa na kumlumizisa, niyo wanyilika wamwasa hagihi no kubanika. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Niyo mlava nt'hambiko yumwenga aselaga ne sila idya, eze amuone yudya mnt'hu niyo ombokela kunk'handa. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Niyo eza Mlawi, yehe naye eze amuone niyo ombokela kunk'handa. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Niyo msamalia yumwenga ombokela hadya haguhi, eze amuone niyo amuwonela mbazi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Niyo amfunga zink'wenge zakwe, no kuzigela mafuta na divai, niyo amguha yudya mnt'hu no kumkweza mwe mp'hunda yakwe na kumwigala mwe nyumba ya wageni vileke wamkaule. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Zuwa ditimile niyo aguha matundu na kuwenk'ha wadya wata inyumba, no kumgamba, ‘Umkaule uyu mnt'hu, kint'hu chochose kiya akuunga umwink'he miye nenize nilihe hauya.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesu niyo abindiliza kwa kugamba, “Mwa want'hu ao watatu, ni ani miyawe dya yudya akump'hukilwe ni wahoki?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Yudya mhinizi we miko iyo ahitula, “Ni yudya amwonele mbazi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu ni amhitula, “Ita ukadamanye enga ivo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awatalamkila Masa na Malia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Umwo Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe wandaga mwo utafi wawe, wengilaga mwe kaya imwenga niyo mvele yumwenga akwitangwa Masa, awahokelaga kwe nyumba yakwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Naho andaga na lumbudye etangagwa Maliamu, ekale he viga va Zumbe akamtegeleza mahinizo yakwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Masa andaga akangadika ne zindima, niyo eza na kumgamba, “Zumbe hukuona hiyo vedi uyu ndugu yangu kunasila zindima nikedu? Hake mgambe eze anambize.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Zumbe niyo amhitula, “Masa! Masa wangadika no kwingila kinyulu mwe kudamanya mbuli nyingi!” <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Mna kint'hu kimwenga du kikuungwa, naho Maliamu kasagula mbuli yedi naho heiuswe mwakwe.<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahiniza mbuli yo kumlombeza Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Aho Yesu eze abinde kulombeza Mnungu, yumwenga mwa wanamp'hina wakwe niyo amgamba, “Zumbe ukihinize kumlombeza Mnungu enga viya Yohana awahinize wanamp'hina wakwe.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mnanda mwo kumlombeza Mnungu, gambeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tati yetu wi kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Zina dyako ditogolwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Useuta wako wize,<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Ukink'he ludyo lwetu lwa dielo.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Kiusile uwavu wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">enga viya suwe kikuwausila wavu wawe wadya wakidamanyile wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">naho usekukigela mwa magezo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Uneva yumwenga ywenyu aita kwa mbwiyaye kilogati niyo amgamba yudya mbwiyaye, ‘Mbuyangu nikopeshe mikate mitatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Hizilwa ni mbuyangu akulawa nt'hambo, naho hina kint'hu cha kumwink'ha adye!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Naho uneva mbuyayo anakuhitula kulawa kwe nyumba, ‘Usekunigela nk'huswank'huswa! Hivugala kale lwivi, naho miye hamwenga wana wangu kigona kale hikudaha kwinuka hwi'nkhe kint'hu chochose.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Neenuke niyo amwink'ha, hiyo kwaviya ni mbwiyaye du, mna neenuke niyo amwink'ha kwaviya halekile kumlombeza kwe yadya akuunga.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Naho namigambilani, lombezeni namhokele, zunguleni naho namuwone, gambeni, Kuno, nomkomoelwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Kwaviya wadya wakulombeza nawahokele, wadya nawo wakuzungula nawaone, naho lwivi naukomwolwe kwa wadya wakugamba, Kuno! <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Hegu eyuko mwa nyuwe akwitangwa tate, uneva mwanawe amlombeza samaki yehe naamwink'he nyoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Hegu naamwink'he kisuse analombeza tagi? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Togoleni want'hu waihile enga nyuwe, mna mwadaha kuwenk'ha wana wenyu vint'hu vedi, Togoleni havitendese kwa Tati yetu ywa kwe mbingu kuwenk'ha Muye ywakwe akukile wadya wakumlombeza?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu no mkulu wa mp'hepo waihile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maliko 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yesu andaga akalava mp'hepo aihile ywa kimumu, naho mp'hepo yudya aihile eze afose yudya mnt'hu niyo akonga kulonga, want'hu niyo weheelwa, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Mna want'hu watuhu niyo wagamba, “Alava mp'hepo waihile kwa udahi wa Belizebuli, Mkulu wa mp'hepo waihile.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Watuhu niyo wamgeza Yesu wakaunga vilagiso vikulawa kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu niyo amanya zifanyanyi zawe niyo awahitula, “Useuta ukukediila gaina woho wenye, nounde uke pusa, naho nyumba ina nk'humbizi haikutoga. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Naho uneva Mwavu kakediila gaina yehe mwenye, useuta wakwe noukimale vivihi? Kwaviya nyuwe mwagamba Belizebuli anink'ha udahi wa kulava mp'hepo. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Uneva miye nalava mp'hepo kwa udahi wa belizebuli, wana wenyu walava vivihi? Wadya wakumitimilani wamanya kugamba, mna masa. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Mna uneva miye nalava mp'hepo kwa udahi wa Mnungu, Useuta wa Mnungu umizilani kale.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Mnt'hu mta ludole aguhile vitoanilo vakwe anayamila inyumba yakwe, yose neinde mp'heho tondolo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Mna uneva mnt'hu mta ludole kujink'ha izakwe anamwizila no kumhuma, naamhoke vitowanilo vakwe vose akuvihuwila no kuwapanganiza wadya awatahile.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Mnt'hu he hamwenga na miye, uyo e kinyume na miye, naho mnt'hu uyo hakuduganya mna amwaganisa.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuya kwa mp'hepo aihile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayo 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Mp'hepo iihile inamfosa mnt'hu, yombokela hant'hu haheina mazi, ikazungula hant'hu ho kuhumuila, hanahaone akegamba, ‘Neniiuiye inyumba yangu nilaile.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Mna anauya niyo aibwila inyumba ihagilwa na kuhambwa, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />naho, naaite no kuguha mp'hepo watuhu waihile kujink'ha yehe mwenye niyo wengila na kwikala umwo, naho mnt'hu yudya hali yakwe yanda iha kujink'ha idya ya nk'hongo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kinyemi che kindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Umwo Yesu andile akalonga ivo, mvele yumwenga mwe difyo iyo niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Kavikilwa mvele akweleke, hamwenga na kukulela.”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Mna Yesu niyo ahitula niyo amgamba, “Wavikilwa wadya wakwiva ulosi wa Mnungu no kuutimila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu waunga vilagiso kulawa kwa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayo 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Want'hu viya wandile wakammemela niyo akonga kulonga, “Cheleko iki kiha, chazungula vilagiso, mna hakihali kilagiso mkuunga mwink'higwe ila kilagiso cha Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Enga viya Yona andile kilagiso kwa want'hu wa Ninawi, nivo akuunga ande mwana Adamu mwe cheleko iki. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Dizuwa dyo usengelo dikabula malikia kulawa Seba naakimale nokuwasengela want'hu wa dielo, kwaviya agendaga kulawa kwe isi yakwe kugenda kumtegeleza Seuta Sulemani na mahinizo yakwe ya mizungu. Naho nawagambilani, hana kint'hu aha kikulu kumjink'ha Sulemani. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Want'hu wa Ninawi nawakimale nawo mwe dizuwa dyo usengelo no kuwasengelani nyuwe kunda na masa kwaviya wahituka kulawa mwo wavu wawe weze weve mabilikizi ya Yona. Naho nawagambilani ikindedi eyuko mkulu aha kumjink'ha Yona.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lwo mwili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Hahali mnt'hu akukweleza lumuli no kulwiika hant'hu hakefisile hegu no kulugubika ne nyungu, mna lwaikwa henukile vileke wakwingila waone ung'azi wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Lumuli lwo umwili ni diziso, uneva ziso dyako dinanda dyedi umwili wako wose nao wanda wedi, mna dinanda dibanika umwili wako wose wanda na ziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Elo kaulisa, ung'azi unanao mwo mwili wako unase kunda ziza. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Uneva umwili wako wose una ung'azi hahana hant'hu hana ziza, umwili wako wose nounde no ung'azi enga viya lumuli lukukumulikila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalongeleza mafalisayo hamwenga na wahinizi we Zisigilizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Umwo andile akalonga ayo Falisayo yumwenga niyo amwitanga aite kwakwe akadye nk'hande, niyo engila no kwikala adye nk'hande. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Falisayo uyo eze amwone Yesu adya nk'hande haheina kuhaka mikono enga viya ikuungwa niyo ehelwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Zumbe niyo amgamba, “Nyuwe Mafalisayo mwasunt'ha vint'hu va kudiila kwa kuse, mna mndani mwenyu mmema wavu na wiihi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Nyuwe wahezi! Mnungu hiye yehe avidamanye va kuse na vakundani? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mna wenk'heni wakiwa vint'hu vimwe vikombe na mwe zinyiga, vose mkuunga mnadamanye, nevinde vedi kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye Mafalisayo, kwaviya mwalava zaka za mnanaa, no mchicha hamwenga ne zimboga naho mwaleka mbuli za mahinizo yedi no lukunde lwa Mnungu, mwaungigwa mdamanye ayo haheina kuyaleka yadya matuhu.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye nyuwe Mafalisayo, kwaviya mwaungisa kwikala mwo ukalo wa kulongole mwe zinyumba zo kumvikila Mnungu hamwenga na kulamswa kwa kogohwa mwa magwilo. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Hangi nyuwe wenye kwaviya mwikala enga vikuta heviwakigwe, naho want'hu wakwomboka mnanga mwawe hawavimanyize.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Mnt'hu yumwenga mwe wahinizi we Miko iyo amhitula, “Mhinizi, ukalonga ayo wakilongeleza hata suwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Hangi nyuwe wenye, nyuwe wahinizi we Miko mwawatwika want'hu nt'wika hezikwinulika, mna nyuwe wenye hamkuzidosa zint'wika izo hata na wadole wenyu. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Hangi nyuwe wenye, kwaviya mwaviwaka vikuta va walotezi mna watati zenyu nawo wawakomile. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kwa ivo mwalonga uwona na kuzumila yadya yadamanywe ni watati zenyu, woho nawawakoma nyuwe nanywe mwaviwaka vikuta vawe. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kwe mbuli iyo mzungu wa Mnungu nougamba, ‘Kaula, neniwegaile walotezi na wegala ulosi, woho nawawakome, hamwenga na kuwasulumiza wamwenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Kwe mbuli iyo want'hu we cheleko iki nawasengelwe kwa kuwakoma walotezi kukongela kuumbigwa kwe isi. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Kukongela sakame ya Habili mpaka sakame ya Zakalia, akomigwe hagati ye vilingo ne Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu. Naho nawagambilani ikindedi kugamba, sakame iyo naiungigwe kulawa mwe cheleko iki.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Hangi nyuwe wenye nyuwe wahinizi we miko kwaviya mkiusa kiya kikomoelo cho ubala wo kwingila kwa Mnungu, wenye hamwingile wadya nawo wandile wakengila mwawafingiza.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yesu eze afose umwo, wahinizi we Miko na Mafalisayo, nawakamviga viga hamwenga na kumgeza kwa maswali yabindile ingi. <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Naho nawakamongola vileke wamgwile kwa mbuli ikulawa mwo mnomo wakwe.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa watondwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayo 10:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Mo wingi wa want'hu wamzungulukaga Yesu, niyo want'hu wata kujatana, Yesu niyo akonga kuwagambila wanamp'hina wakwe, “Indeni na wengele mkeamile no ugwadu wa mafalisayo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Mna haihali mbuli ya kifiso heize imanyike naho hata diya difisigwe nedize dimanyike. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Kwa ivo yadya yose myalongele mwo lwiza nayeze yevike kungaile, na yadya mtile kutakamizana kwe chumba kundani, nayeze yabilikizwe kulanga kwe zinyumba.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akuungwa kogohwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayo 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Nawagambilani nyuwe wambuya zangu, mse kuwogoha wadya wakudaha kukoma umwili niyo hawakudaha kudamanya chochose kiihile, <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />mna neniwalagise yudya mkuungigwa mmogohe, mwogoheni Mnungu yehe akudaha kukoma mnt'hu na kumgela mwo moto houkuzima wa mazuwa yose, namigambilani mwogoheni uyo!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Watolondo waidi hawakutagigwa kwa matundu mageke? Naho hakakujaligwa hata kamwenga mwa meso ya Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Mna hata fili zimwe imitwi yenyu zoseni ziwazwa, msekogoha nyuwe wedi vitendese, kujink'ha madege.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumzumila na kumlemela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Nawagambilani ikindedi yudya akuunga ana nzumile mwa meso ya want'hu, mwana wa Mnt'hu naye naamzumile hameso ya mtumigwa ywa Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Mna yoyose akuunga anilemele, kwa want'hu, name nenimlemele mwa meso ya mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu ywa Mnungu.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Yeyose akumlongela mbuli yeyose iihile mwana wa mnt'hu, naausilwe wavu wakwe, mna akumhomola Muye ywa Mnungu haausilwe wavu wakwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Wanamigalani mwe nyumba za Mnungu, hamwenga na kwa maliwali na wata udahi, msekogoha mkafanyanya viya mkunga muwahitule na kulonga. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Kwaviya Muye ywa Mnungu naawahinizize yadya mkuunga mlonge.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgoli mhezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mnt'hu yumwenga mdya mwo diya difyo, niyo amgambila Yesu, “Mhinizi, mgambile ngugu ywangu anink'he kipe changu mwo udya chasilwe ni tati yetu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Mbuyangu, ni ani anitendile miye ninde mlamuzi mwa nyuwe?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Niyo awagamba, “Hangi nyuwe wenye, msekunda na ugubaguba wi hengi, Kwaviya, ugima wa, mnt'hu haumuli mwe wingi we vint'hu vakwe ananavo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yesu niyo awagambila mliganyizo, “Mgunda wa mnt'hu yumwenga mgoli na welekesaga, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Mnt'hu yudya niyo akonga kubanikanyanya kwo umoyo wakwe, na kugamba, ‘Nenitende vivihi Kwaviya hina hant'hu ho kuikila ulozo uno? <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Niyo agamba, nenidamanye ivi,’ nenimole magulu yangu yose niyo nazenga matuhu makulu, ‘mwa magulu ayo neniike nk'hande yangu yose na vint'hu vangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Aho, neniugambe umoyo wangu, haluse hikwiikila nk'hande ye myaka yose, kehumuile, udye, unywe, unde ne kinyemi!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Mna Mnungu niyo amgamba, ‘Weye u mhezi, kilo iki cha dyelo waunga umoyo wako, ivint'hu vose wiikile ne vinde vaani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yesu niyo abindiliza kwa kugamba, “Nivo vili kwa mnt'hu akukeikila ugoli mna hakukeika lumwe kwe mbuli ya Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhuwile Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayo 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Niyo Yesu awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Kwa mbuli iyo nawagambilani, msekufanyanya nomdyei, hegu nomvalei. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Kwaviya ugima wajink'ha nk'hande, umwili nao wajink'ha suke. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Hake kauleni amakungulu, hayakuhanda, hayakuvuna naho hayana magulu, mna Mnungu ayenk'ha nk'hande. Nyuwe mwi wedi vitendese kujink'ha wadege. <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ni yuhi mwa nyuwe akudaha kukeongezela utali wakwe hata mkono umwenga? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Uneva hamkudaha dodo sa idyo, ni kugoha izimbuli zint'huhu? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Kauleni mabwali ivo yakuhota, haya kudamanya ndima naho hayakukedamanyila suke, namigambilani, hata zumbe Sulemani no uwedi utendese wakwe akei kuvaligwa vedi enga bwali dyodyose mwa aya. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Uneva Mnungu ayavala vedi mani ya kwe mbago, yoho dielo yeaho mna luvi yaduulwa kwe mbago, ivo haawadamanyileni nyuwe vitendese, nyuwe mhungukilwe ni mhuwi?<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Nyuwe msekwangadika kwa kiya mkuunga mdye na kiya mkuunga mnywe, naho msekunda na kituletule, <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />kwaviya ayo yose want'hu we isi, wangadika wakayazungula. Mna Tati yenyu wa kwe mbingu kamanya kugamba mwayaunga ayo. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Kongeni kuuzungula Useuta wa Mnungu ayo yose namwongezelwe.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ugoli wa kwo ulanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayo 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Nyuwe bunga dodo, msekogoha, kwaviya Tati yenyu kelelwa kuwenk'hani Useuta. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Tageni ivint'hu venyu vose mkawenk'he wakiwa, kedamanyileni mikwiji heikusakala, kindolo hekikuhunguka ukwo kwe mbingu hant'hu hahekubuligwa ni mbavi naho hezidingwe ni vuvu. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Kwaviya vindolo venyu hadya vikuunga vinde naaho imioyo yenyu ikuunga ikale.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wandima wedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Keikeni lumwe kwa mbuli yoyose idya ikuunga ilaile, naho vimuli venyu vinde vakweela. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Nanywe indeni enga want'hu wakumgojela zumbe ywawe akuunga auye kulawa kwe ndoza, vileke aneza na kugamba kuno, wamkomwoele. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Wavikilwa wadya wandima umwo zumbe ywawe uneva akauya naawabwiile we meso. Nawagambilani ikindedi, naahambule dikoti dyakwe niyo awagamba wahumule hasi niyo awaikila nk'hande. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Wavikilwa uneva aneza mwe kilo gati niyo awabwiila we meso. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Mna mmanye kugamba, mta nyumba amanyize lupisi akwizila mbavi hegu nakekala meso, seka nyumba yakwe ikamoligwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Nyuwe nanywe keikeni lumwe, kwaviya mwana Mnt'hu neeze mwo lupisi ludya hemwilumanyize.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndima mhuwilwa na mndima hi huwilwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayo 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Petulo niyo amgamba, “Zumbe mliganyizo uno wetu suwe, hegu wa want'hu wose?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Zumbe niyo amhitula, “Ni ani elo mndima mhuwilwa mbala, akuunga aikigwe ni zumbe ywakwe kunda mkimalizi mwo undima wakwe wose, akuwenk'ha nk'hande mwo lupisi ludya lukuungwa? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Kavikilwa mtumwa uyo, umwo zumbe ywakwe akauya ambwiila akadamanya enga ivo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ikindedi nawagambilani, naamwiike ande mkimalizi we vint'hu vakwe vose. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Mna uneva mtumwa yudya analonga mwo moyo wakwe kugamba, mkulu ywakwe hakusunguza kuuya niyo akonga kuwatoa wandima watuhu, we kigosi na we kivele, hamwenga na kukonga kudya na kunywa no kukolwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />mkulu ywakwe mtumwa uyo naauye zuwa hedikumanyika naho mwo lupisi helukumanyika. Uyo mkulu ywakwe naamsengele niyo amwiika hamwenga na wadya hi wahuwilwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Mna mtumwa yudya amanyize ivo akuunga mkulu ywakwe, mna hadamanye viya akuunga uyo mkulu nywakwe naamsulumizise. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Mna yudya hemmanyize mna kadamanya vikuungwa naatoigwe ludodo. Naho kila enk'higwe vingi kulawa kwakwe neviungwe vingi, naho yudya amwikile ukulu we vint'hu vingi kulawa kwakwe awaunge vingi.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atenda want'hu wapangane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayo 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Hiza vileke isi inde mwo moto, naho ivi naluse moto ukimp'huka! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Mna nnanawo ubatizo nikuungigwa nibatizwe, name nna makunt'ho yatendese mpaka niyakint'hize. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Togoleni mwagamba hiza kwigala utondowazi mwe isi? Hiyo ivo hiza vileke kunde na kupangana. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kukongela ivi haluse, nyumba ya want'hu washano ne inde ikepanga, watatu kwa waidi, waidi kwa watatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Watate hawaivane na wana wawe wana nawo hawaivane na watati zawe. Wamnala nao hawaivane na wana wawe we kike, wana kike nawo hawaivane na wamamizawe. Wamnala hawaivane na wake wana wawe, wake wana nawo hawaivane na wamamizawe vyala.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuyamanya mazuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu alonga na want'hu naho kugamba, “Mnaona vunde ditandala kwo uswelo wa zuwa, mwagamba fula yeza naho yanda ivo, <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Mnaona mp'heho nk'hali yavuguta, mwagamba nokubwikane, naho vanda iivo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Nyuwe watondwe Mwamanya kubunk'hula hali ye isi no ulanga, yanda vihi kunda hammanyize kuvumbula zimbuli zo lupisi ulu?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivana no wavu ywako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Nii hamkudaha kulamula nyuwe wenye mbuli zo wedi zo kudamanya? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Kwaviya unatimilana na yudya akukulogeleza mkaita kwa mlamuzi, kombeka mwivane umwo mwe sila, mnase kukwigala mlamuzi, yudya mlamuzi naakwigale mtowani akuunga akugele mwa masa naho naakuvugaile mwe divugailo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nakugambila, houfose umwo mpaka ulihe pele tundu ukutigizwa.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Lekeni wavu wenyu mnase kubanika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Mwo lupisi ludya handaga na want'hu wamgambilaga Yesu mbuli ya Wagalilaya wakomigwe ni Pilato umwo wandaga wakalava nt'hambiko kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu niyo awahitula akawagamba, “Nyuwe mwagamba wadya wagalilaya nawandilisa wavu, kujink'ha wagalilaya watuhu, vikaleka wakomwe? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Nawagambani hiyo ivo, mna nyuwe nanywe hamnakweiile wavu wenyu, nanywe nombanike enga viya wabanike woho. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Hegu wadya mlongo na mnane, wagweelwe nu mnala kudya Siloamu niyo wabanika, mwagamba watenda wavu kujink'ha watuhu wose wakwikala Yelusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ikindedi hiyo ivo, Naho nawagambilani kugamba, hamna kweiile wavu wenyu, nombanike enga viya wabanike woho.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo mti ukwitangwa mtini houkweleka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Niyo Yesu awagambila mliganyizo uno ukugamba, “kwandaga na mnt'hu ahandaga tini mwe nk'honde ye mizabibu. Agendaga kukaula uneva naapate tunda dyakwe, mna niyo aswesa. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Niyo amgamba yudya akwamila, kaula myaka mitatu hinda heza vileke nikaule ntini mwo mtini uno, mna hikuona chochose, usenge ugwe hasi niiwakula kwa kubananga isanga bule? <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Mna yudya mwamizi niyo amhitula, ‘Zumbe, vileke naho mo umwaka uno, niuhailile na kuugeela uwolo. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Niho, u neva uneleka mo mwaka ukwiza, nevindilise ni vedi, mna hauneleke wadaha kuusegela hasi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mvele yumwenga mwe di zuwa dyo kuhumula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Zuwa dimwenga dyo kuhumula, Yesu andaga aka hiniza mwe nyumba yo kuvikila. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Aaho handaga na mvele yumwenga andaga na mp'hepo, yamtendaga ande mnyonge kwa myaka mlongo na mnane, naho nakabunt'hika, heekudaha kukimaala kwa kuchuluka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu eze amuone niyo amwitanga, no kumgamba mnala kuhonyigwa unyonge wako. <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Niyo amwikila mikono, ahadya mwili wakwe niyo wachuluka, niyo akonga kumtogola Mnungu<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Mna mkulu we nyumba ya kuvikila, ahigagwa kwaviya Yesu amhonyaga Mnt'hu mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula, ivo niyo awagamba want'hu, “yeyuko mazuwa nt'hatu ya kudamanya ndima, ivo mwize mwa mazuwa ayo mwize mhonywe!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Mna Zumbe Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nyuwe watondwe! Kila yumwenga ywenyu hakukomoela mp'hunda yakwe hegu ng'ombe kulawa kwe didewa no kugenda kuinywesa kwa mazi mwe di zuwa dyo kuhumula? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Uyu mvele ni ywa cheleko cha Ibulahimu, kazinganizwa ni Mwavu kwa myaka mlongo na mnane, togola hivo vedi kuhonyigwa mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Eze alonge ayo wahigani wakwe wose wengilaga soni, mna want'hu waonaga kinyemi kwe zimbuli ziya Yesu andamanyaga.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we mbeyu indodo kujink'ha mbeyu zose mwe isi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Matayo 13:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu niyo auza, “Useuta wa Mnungu ni kint'hu chani? Naho niuliganyize nai? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Wikala enga ivi. Mt'hu yumwenga aguhaga kabeyu kadodo kujink'ha vibeyu vose vidodo vi mwe isi, niyo akamyaga mwe nk'honde yakwe, niyo kakula no kutenda ziti kulu, niyo madege yeza kuzenga masasa yawe mwa matambi yakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo ugwadu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Niyo auza naho, “Neni uliganyize na kint'hu chani Useuta wa Mnungu? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Wikala enga ivi, Mvele yumwenga aguhaga kint'hu cho ugwadu, niyo ahanganya na mp'hishi milongo mine yo unga, niyo unga wose wagwaduka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwivi lufinyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu ombokelaga mwe mizi na mwe zi kaya, akahiniza want'hu no kugendeela ne nt'hambo yakwe kuita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mnt'hu yumwenga niyo amwuza, “Zumbe, niwant'hu wageke wakuunga wayokolwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu amhitulaga kugamba, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Mkombeke kombokela mwo lwivi lufinyu, kwaviya want'hu wengi nawaungise kwingila mwo lwivi ulo, mna hawadahe. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Aho mta inyumba naakimale no kuvugala ulwivi, niho mkeza kukimaala kuse no kuita ho lwivi no kugamba, ‘Kikomoele Zumbe!’ Naawahituleni kugamba, ‘Hiwamanyizeni uko mkulawa!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Niho nomkonge kugamba suwe niwadya nekikadya no kunywa hamwenga na weye, nawe nouka kihiniza mwe mizi yetu. <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Mna naahitule kugamba, ‘Hiwamanyizeni uko mkulawa, halaweni aha nyuwe awavu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Niho nokunde na ndilo no kugwegwejula meno, aho nomuwaone Ibulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo na walotezi wa Mnungu wose mo useuta wa Mnungu, umwo nyuwe mkaduulwa kuse. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Want'hu naweze kulawa uailo na usweelo wa zuwa, na nt'hendelo zose ze isi, nokwikala hasi ho Useuta wa Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Nivo wose weko uheelo nawande wa nk'hongo, wadya wa nk'hongo nawo nawazigiile.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukunde lwa Yesu kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Lupisi uludya Mafalisayo wamwenga wambasaga Yesu, niyo wamgamba, “Halawe aha wiite hant'hu hatuhu, kwaviya Helode aunga akukome.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Iteni mka digambile idyo diuzi kugamba, ‘diyelo na luvi nagulusa mp'hepo na kuhonya wanyonge, naho zuwa dya katatu neni bindilize indima yangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Hata ivo vaniunga kutoza sila yangu dielo na luvi na kisindo, kwaviya hivo vedi kwa mlotezi kukomwa hant'hu hohose ila mwe Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yelusalemu! Weye, Yelusalemu, wawakoma walotezi na kuwatoa maiwe wadya wasigiilwe ni Mnungu kwako, malavo nyingahi niungile niwakunyatile want'hu wako enga viya nguku ikuya kunyatila hamwenga makinda yakwe, mna weye huungile. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Kauleni nawasilani inyumba yenyu. Nawagambilani ikindedi homnione naho, mpaka aho nomwize mgambe, ‘kavikilwa ni Mnungu yehe akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mnyonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Zuwa dimwenga dya kuhumula Yesu nakaita kudya mkande kwe kaya ya mnt'hu yumwenga kilongozi ywa Mafalisayo, aho handaga na want'hu wandaga wakampelemba Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Naho, handaga na mnt'hu yumwenga andile na unyonge wa belebele amwizilaga Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesu niyo awauza wahinizi we Miko hamwenga na Mafalisayo kugamba ni vedi, “Miko yetu yakilekela kiwahonye want'hu mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Mna niyo wanyamala. Yesu amtozaga yudya mnyonge niyo amhonya niyo amlekela akeitile. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Eze ajike, niyo wawagamba, “Uneva yumwenga ywenyu anamwana hegu ng'ombe yakwe ingile mwe dibome, naho ni mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula, haailave kwaviya ni zuwa dya kuhumula?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Niyo wadunduga kumhitula mbuli ino.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukise no kufinyiliza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu nakaona wadya walalikwe ivo nandaga wakasagula nk'halo zikulongole niyo awagambila mliganyo uno, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Uneva unalalikwa mwe ndoza, use kwikala mwe zink'halo zikulongole inase kunda kuna mtuhu kukujink'ha weye alalikwe nu mkulu, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />yudya naye awalalike aneza naakugambe, ‘Mwink'he sila miyao ekale mwo ukalo uno.’ Niho kwa soni noukekale kwo ukalo wa kunyuma. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Mna unalalikwa, ita ukekale kwo ukalo ukunyuma, vileke yudya akulalike aneza akugambe, ‘Mbuyangu, so uku kulongole.’ Ino neikwink'he uwedi utendese mwa meso ya wose mwikalanye hamwenga. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwaviya wadya wakukekweza, nawaselezwe yudya naye akukeseleza naakwezwe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yesu niyo amgamba yudya amlalike mwo wila, “Uneva unadamanya wila, usekulalika wambuyazo, hegu nduguzo, hegu ugoli, kwa idi unase kunda kulihigwa kwa yadya udamanye. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Mna unadamanya wila, uwalalike wadya hewena kint'hu, hamwenga na wadya hewekudaha kugenda, waholomp'hale, na hamwenga na mant'hunt'hu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />unatenda ivo no unde kuvikilwa kwaviya woho hawana kint'hu cha kukuliha, noulihigwe mwo kuuyulwa kwa wadya wedi wasagulwe ni Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa wila mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Mnt'hu yumwenga mwa wadya wekale na Yesu he nk'hande eze eve ivo niyo amgamba Yesu, “Nawande na kinyemi wadya wose wakuunga wekale hamwenga na Zumbe ho ludyo kwo Useuta wa Mnungu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu niyo amhitula, “Mnt'hu yumwenga na kadamanya wila mkulu niyo alalika want'hu wengi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Wila wize ubule niyo amsigiila mtumwa ywakwe akawetange wadya wose awalalike kwaviya kila kint'hu nekiika lumwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Kila yumwenga mwa wadya walalikwe wandaga hawabuile. Ywa nk'hongo agambaga, ‘higula nk'honde, ivo vaniunga hailaule, nakweiila, nnekele haikaule.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Mtuhu niyo agamba, ‘Higula ng'ombe mlongo za kulimila ivo nagenda kuzigeza, nilekele niite.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Mtuhu niyo amgamba, ‘Hilomba mvele, kwaivo henize.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Yudya mtumwa auyaga niyo amgambila zumbe ywakwe mbuli zose ivo zilaile. Yudya mkulu ahigagwa niyo amgamba mtumwa ywakwe, ‘Ita kwe zisila zi mk'handa na mwo mzi ukawaguhe haweena kint'hu ne viwete, na mant'hunt'hu, hamwenga na wadya waholomp'hale.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Yudya mtumwa eze auye niyo agamba, ‘zumbe, hidamanya enga viya ulagize mna nyumba ikei kumema.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Zumbe niyo amgamba mtumwa ywakwe, ‘Ita mwe zisila mp'handa na kwe mihaka yo mzi ukawatigize want'hu weze vileke nyumba yangu imeme. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kwa ivo nawagambilani hahali hata yumwenga mwe wadya walalikwe nk'hongo, akuunga auvine uwila wangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maliho yo wakumtimila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Aho, Yesu awahitukilaga want'hu wengi awo wandaga wakamtimila, no kuwagamba, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Uneva mnt'hu yeyose anibasa, hakudaha kunda mwanamp'hina ywangu uneva hakuniungisa miye kujink'ha welesi wakwe, na mkaziwe na wanawe na nduguze wa kigosi, na walumbuze, hamwenga na kujink'ha ivo akuungisa ugima wakwe mwenye. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Heekudaha kwinula msalaba wakwe niyo anibasa hakudaha kunda mwanamp'hina ywangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Nauza, Ni yuhi mwa nyuwe anaunga kuzenga mnala hakwikala hasi na kuwaza ndima akuunga aidamanye na maliho yakwe vileke amanye kugamba ana matundu yakudaha kuibinda indima? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Anase akadunduga kubindiliza anajika kusimba ink'hongelo du, niyo want'hu wose wamseka, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />wakagamba, ‘Mnt'hu uyu akakongaga kuzenga mna habindile!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Hegu eyuko zumbe yeyose anaunga kugenda kutoana na zumbe miyawe, hakwikala hasi na kufanyanya kugamba yehe hamwenga na want'hu alufu nawadahe kutowana na yudya akwiza na want'hu alufu mbili? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Hegu anaona haadahe, neegale ulosi aunge utondowazi, umwo yudya zumbe miyawe akei ehale. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Enga kila yumwenga ywenyu” uneva hakudaha kwasa viya “ananavo hakudaha kunda mwanamp'hina ywangu.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyu ubanike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Munyu, wedi, mna unabanika noutendigwe vivihi vileke unde wedi naho? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Haikuwagila mwe isi, hegu du hata kwe dizala, waduulwa hale vitendese. Mta magutwi neeve!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ngoto yagile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayo 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Zuwa dimwenga watoza ushulu wengi hamwenga na wata wavu wagendaga kumtegeleza Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mafalisayo na wahinizi we Miko iyo wakongaga kulafya, “Mnt'hu uyu awetanga wata wavu naho adya nao!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yesu niyo awagambila mliganyizo uno,<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Uneva yumwenga ywenyu ana ngoto gana imwenga niyo yaga, naatende vivihi? Naazileke ziya milongo kenda na kenda niyo aita kuizungula idya yagile mpaka aione. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Anaiona akepika mwa maega kwa kinyemi, <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />no kuuya nayo kaya. Akabula kaya awetanga wambuyaze na nduguze niyo awagamba, ‘Indeni na kinyemi, kwaviya hiiona ingoto yangu yagile.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Namigambilani, ivo nivo kukuunga kunde na kinyemi kwe mbingu kwa mbuli ya mta wavu yumwenga alekile wavu wakwe, kujink'ha wadya milongo kenda na kenda wandile wedi kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tundu dyagile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Hegu eyuko mvele yeyose mta matundu yakwe mlongo, anaza dimwenga haakweleze lumuli lwakwe no kuhagila nyumba ingima niyo azungula mpaka adione? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Anadiona naawetange wambuyaze na wemgihi niyo kuwagamba, ‘Indeni na kinyemi kwaviya ne hyaza tundu dyangu mna hidiona.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, viligane na ivo, nivo wakunda na kinyemi watumigwa wa kwe mbingu uneva mnt'hu yumwenga mta wavu anamuuiya Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana agile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu niyo agendeela kulonga, “Mnt'hu yumwenga na kanda na wana waidi, <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />yudya umdodo niyo amgamba ise, ‘Tate nink'he ukipe wangu.’ Ise azumilaga niyo kumwink'ha. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Yeze yomboke mazuwa mageke yudya mwana niyo aguha vint'hu vakwe vose no kutamba isi ya hale. Niyo abinda ugoli wakwe wose kwa mbuli ya uhabwasi. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Eze abinde vose viya endile navo niyo kwengila gumbo kulu mwe isi yose idya, yehe naye niyo anda hana kint'hu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Niyo alombeza ndima kwa mnt'hu yumwenga mwe idya isi. Yudya mnt'hu niyo amwigala kwe nk'honde yakwe akenk'hize zinguluwe nk'hande. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Naaka munk'hwa adye usiga zisigaze zinguluwe, mna hahali mnt'hu amwink'haga. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Eze ekale hasi na kufanyanya, niyo alonga mo moyo wakwe, ‘Kudya kaya, tate ana wandima wakudya nk'hande na kusigaza, mna miye nafa sala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Neniite kwa tate niyo namgamba, Tate, hitenda wavu kwa Mnungu hamwenga na weye, <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />hiwagilwe kwitangwa mwanao, nitende enga yumwenga mwa watumwa wako.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Niyo akonga nt'hambo ya kuuya kwa ise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Eze ande hagihi na kaya, ise niyo amuona. Eze amuone, niyo amgulukila kwa mbazi na kumlamsa kwa kumkumbatila. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Yudya mwana niyo amgambila ise, ‘Tate hidamanya wavu kwa Mnungu hamwenga na kwako, hiwagilwe kwitangwa mwanao naho.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Mna ise niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, ‘Sunguzeni mmwigaile suke yedi mumvike, mgeleni na mp'hete mwa kadole niyo mwamvala vilatu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Leteni ndama igimbale muichinje vileke kidye no kunda na kinyemi. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Kwaviya uyu mwanangu andaga enga kabanika mna kauyuka naho agaga mna kaoneka.’ Niyo wakonga kwanga.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Yudya mwanawe mkulu andaga kwe nk'honde umwo andile akauya na mpaka hagihi ne nyumba niyo eva want'hu wakwanga. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Niyo amwitanga mtumwa yumwenga no kumuuza, ‘Kuna mbwai?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Yudya mtumwa niyo amhitula, ‘Nduguyo kauya,’ ‘naho iso kamchinjila ndama igimbale kwaviya kampata akei mgima.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Yudya mwana mkulu niyo aihiwa no kulemela kwingila kaya. Ise niyo afosa kuse na kumhembeleza engile kwe nyumba. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Mna niyo amhitula ise, ‘Tate hake kaula, mazuwa yose nakudamanyila ndima enga mtumwa, naho hikwihiye mwe mbuli yoyose. Kunink'hai? Hunink'hile hata kabuzi vileke nidamanye wila na wambuyazangu, <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />mna uyu mwanao adile ugoli wako hamwenga na mapamp'he, eze auye niyo wamchinjila ndama idya igimbale!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Ise niyo amhitula, ‘mwanangu,’ ‘weye wi hamwenga na miye mazuwa yose, chochose kiya nnanacho ni chako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Nevinda vedi kudamanya wila na kunda na kinyemi kwaviya uyu nduguyo andaga enga kabanika, mna kauyuka naho agaga mna kalondoka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mndima hi mhuwilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Na handa na mnt'hu yumwenga, mgoli andile na mkimaila mbuli ywakwe. Nakalongelezwa kugamba naakabulunk'hanya ugoli wakwe.” <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Yudya mgoli niyo amwitanga no kumuuza, “Ino mbuli yani hwiva umwako? Nink'he uwazilo wo ukimalizi wako kwaviya hukudaha kugendeela kunda mkimalizi.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Yudya mkimalizi mbuli niyo akelongela mwo umoyo wakwe, “Nitende vivihi? Kwaviya zumbe ywangu aunga aniuse mwe ndima ino. Miye name hikudaha kulima naho hata kulombeza naona soni! <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Himanya idyo huunga nidamanye vileke wananifoseza mwo umkimalizi wanizumile mwe zinyumba zawe.”<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Niyo awetanga wadya wose wakudaiwa ni zumbe ywakwe, kukongela mnt'hu ya nk'hongo mpaka kwa mtuhu, niyo akonga kumgamba yudya ywa nk'hongo, “Zumbe ywangu ukudai yombe dyani?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Niyo amhitula, “Mavuta misungi gana.” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Niyo amwuza mgeni mtuhu, “Weye wadaiwa yombe dyani?” Niyo amhitula, “Uhule magunia gana dimwenga.” Yudya mkimalizi niyo amgamba, “Guha ikalatasi yako ye dideni uwandike milongo mnane.”<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Yudya zumbe niyo amtogola yudya mkimalizi aihile kwa yadya adamanye kwa ubala, kwaviya wana we isi ino mwe cheleko chawe wanda na ubala kujink'ha wana wo ung'azi.<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Name nawagambilani, ketendeleni wambuya kwa ugoli wa wiihi wa mwe isi, vileke unasila wawalalikeni mwo mzi wa mazuwa yose.” <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Mnt'hu yeyose mhuwilwa mwe mbuli ndodo na ende mhuwilwa mwe mbuli nk'hulu. Yudya naye hi mhuwilwa mwe mbuli ndodo na ande hi mhuwilwa mwe mbuli nk'hulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Uneva nyuwe hamwandile wahuwilwa mwe mbuli ziihile za mwe isi, niani akuunga awahuwile mwo ugoli wa kulanga? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Hegu mkaswesa uhuwilwa mwe vint'hu va want'hu, niyuhi akuunga awenk'heni vint'hu venyu nyuwe wenye?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Hahali mtumwa akudaha kunda mtumwa ywa mazumbe waidi, kwaviya naamwihie yumwenga na kumwungisa mtuhu, hegu naaivane na yumwenga na kulemana na mtuhu. Hamkudaha kumdamanyila ndima Mnungu na kuudamanyila ndima ugoli.<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi mtuhu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mna kwaviya mafalisayo wenye wandaga wakaungisa matundu, weze weve ayo yose, niyo wamtendela lubezo Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nyuwe mwaketenda want'hu wedi kujink'ha watuhu, mna Mnungu kamanya imioyo yenyu, kwaviya kint'hu kikuoneka kunda chedi kwa want'hu, kwa Mnungu chaoneka hi kint'hu.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Sigilizi za musa enk'higwe ni Mnungu hamwenga na mawandiko ya walotezi vandaga uko mpaka mwe lupisi che Yohana mbatizi, kukongela aho Useuta wa Mnungu wabilikizwa naho kila yumwenga awingila kwa ludole. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Mna ni vihufu vitendese mbingu ne Isi komboka, mna haikudahika kuusa hata helufi imwenga mndani mwe miko.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Mnt'hu yoyose akumwasa mkaziwe niyo alomba mtuhu, ahabwasa. Na yudya akuunga amlombe yudya asigwe ahabwasa.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mgoli na mkiwa Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Handaga na mnt'hu yumwenga mgoli, Availe suke zedi vidala na kwikala wikazi wedi vitendese. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Naho, handaga na mkiwa yumwenga akwitangwa Lazalo, mkiwa uyo na kanda na nkhenge mwili wose, want'hu nawakamgoneza ho lwivi we inyumba ya yudya mgoli. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Yudya mkiwa naakaungisa adye masigazi yatomokaga hasi kulawa mwe meza idya akudiila mgoli. Naho makuli nayakeza yakamlambita mwezinkwenge zakwe hadya agonile.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Yudya mkiwa niyo abanika, mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu niyo wamguha akwikala haguhi na Ibulahimu. Yudya mgoli naye niyo abanika na kumoswa msanga. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Mgoli niyo anda na masulumizo vidala kudya masinyungu, eze enule meso yakwe, kwa hale niyo amuwona Ibulahimu kekala hagihi na Lazalo. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Niyo etanga kwa Izwi kulu, ‘Tate Ibulahimu, nonele mbazi. Mgambe Lazalo achank'hize kadole mwa mazi vileke ausangalaze lulimi lwangu. Kwaviya ni mwe masulumizo makulu mwo umoto uno.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Ibulahimu niyo amhitula, ‘Mwanangu, kumbukila weye viya uhokele yedi mwe wikazi wako kwe isi, mna Lazalo nakahokela yaihile. Mna ivi haluse yehe ahokela yedi mna weye wasulumizwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Naho mna, hagati hetu, nyuwe na suwe hana bome kulu vileke wadya wakunga kulawa nt'hendelo imwenga kwita nt'huhu wasekudaha.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Yudya mgoli niyo agamba, ‘Haluse, Tate nakulombeza umsigile kwe inyumba ya wandugu zangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kwaviya nnanawo wandugu washano vileke akawagambile, woho nao wanase wabule hant'hu aha ha masulumizo.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Mna Ibulahimu niyo amgamba, ‘Wanduguzo nawamtegeleze Musa hamwenga na walotezi wa Mnungu watuhu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mna yudya mgoli niyo agamba, ‘Hiyo ivo tate Ibulahimu uneva mnt'hu anauyuka kulawa uku nawamhitukile Mnungu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Mna Ibulahimu niyo amhitula, ‘Uneva hawanawevile Musa na walotezi wa Mnungu watuhu, hata anauyuka mnt'hu anawabasa hawamwive.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Wavu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayo 18:6-7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maliko 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Mbuli zikumtenda mnt'hu agwe mwe wavu zaungigwa zilaile, mna naakaulise mnt'hu uyo akutenda mbuli izo zilaile.” <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ne vinda vedi mnt'hu uyo iwe kulu difungigwe mwe singo yakwe akadulwe mwe bahali. Mna kujink'ha kumwazaganya yumwenga mwa wadodo awa niyo wadamanya wiihi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Hangi nyuwe wenye! Uneva nduguyo anakutendela viihile mkanye, naho anakeiila muusile wavu. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Hegu anakwihiza malavo mfungate mwe zuwa dimwenga na kwiza kwako malavo mfungate na kukugamba hikudamanyila viihile! Muusile uwavu.<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Wegala ulosi niyo wamgamba, “Zumbe uchongezele mhuwi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Zumbe naye niyo awahitula, “Mwandile na mhuwi mdodo enga mbeyu ye haladali, namkadaha kuugambila mti uno, ‘Ng'oka wite kwe bahali, nao niyo wakutegeleza.’<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ivo akuungigwa kudamanya mtumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Uneva yumwenga wenyu ana mtumwa ywakwe akulima kwo mgunda, hegu akudima magoto naho anauya kulawa kwo mgunda naamgambe, soo udye nk'hande? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Haikudahika! Naamgambe, ‘Nitengele nk'hande yangu, naho nigojele ninde kudya hakuheza naaho weye ukonge kukedamanyila nk'hande yako.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Naamtogole yudya mtumwa kwaviya katimila yadya agambilwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Iviya, hata nyuwe mnadamanya yadya yose mgambilwe gambeni, ‘Suwe kiwandima mzungu kint'hu naho kidamanya yadya nekikaungigwa kidamanye.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya want'hu mlongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Umwo Yesu andile mwe int'hambo ya kwita Yelusalemu, nakombokela mwe imihaka ye Samalia na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Viya andile akengila mwe kaya, niyo adugana na want'hu mlongo wandile wakahuma matana. Wakimalaga hale, <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />niyo wakweza izwi wakagamba, “Zumbe Yesu, ukionele mbazi,”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Eze awaone niyo awagamba, “Iteni kwa walava nt'hambiko, mkakelagise.” Mna Umwo wakaita, niyo amatana yawe yahona. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumwenga eze aone kahonywa niyo auya uku akamtogola Mnungu kwa izwi kulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Niyo amfikila Yesu madi na kumtogola, naho mnt'hu uyo andaga Msamalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Wahonyigwe na wanda mlongo, wadya kanda weihi? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Hahali mtuhu auiye kwiza kumtogola Mnungu mna nu uyu Mgeni du?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kimala ukeitile, mhuwi wako ukuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imiziile yo Useuta wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayo 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Mafalisayo watuhu niyo wamuuza Yesu kugamba, Useuta wa Mnungu nowize ini? Yesu niyo awahitula, “Useuta wa Mnungu howize kwa kuukaula kaula. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Naho hahali akudaha kugamba, ‘Kaula!’ Wi uku. ‘Hegu wi kudya!’ kwaviya Useuta wa Mnungu wi mndani mwenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Mazuwa yeza yadya nomuungise kuwona dimwenga mwa mazuwa ya mwana ywa mnt'hu, mna homuwone hata dimwenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Naho want'hu nawamigambeni, ‘Kauleni e kudya hegu e uku!’ Msekuita naho msekuwatimila. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Kwaviya enga lumwemwe ukukweela na kulangaza uko na uko nivo nainde imiziile yakwe mwana wa Adamu mwe dizuwa idyo. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Mna aungigwa ande kusulumizwa na kulemelwa na want'hu wa amazuwa aya. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Enga viya vandile mwe ulupisi cha Nuhu, nivo vikunga vinde mwe ulupisi cha Mwana wa Adamu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Want'hu nawakadya na ukunywa, nawakalomba na kulombigwa mpaka lupidi ludya Nuhu eze engile mwe safina. Mazi niyo yalaila na kuwakoma wose. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Nainde enga viya valailaga mwe ulupisi cha Lutu, want'hu nawakadya na ukunywa, wakagula na kutaga, wakamyaga na kuzenga. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Mna mwe dizuwa diya Lutu eze ahalawe mwe Isi ye Sodoma niyo kwalaila moto wa chola kulanga niyo want'hu wose wakomwa pele. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ivo niivo vikunga vinde mwe dizuwa dia akwizila Mwana ywa Mnt'hu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Zuwa idyo mnt'hu yeyose emnanga mwe digulu asekuseela kwita kwe nyumba kuguha ivint'hu vakwe. Sa ivo mnt'hu ekwe nk'honde asekuuya kaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Kumbukileni yadya yampataga mkaza Lutu <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Mnt'hu yeyose akuunga awazaganye umoyo wakwe naauhonye, na yudya akuunga auhonye na awaze. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nawagambilani, mwe kilo che dizuwa idyo, want'hu waidi nawande wagona hamwenga, yumwenga naaguhigwe, mna mtuhu naasigwe. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Wavele waidi nawande hamwenga mwo kubunda, yumwenga naaguhigwe na mtuhu naasigwe.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Want'hu waidi nawande kwo mgunda yumwenga naaguhigwe mna umtuhu naasigwe<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Wana mp'hina niyo wamuuza Yesu, “Zumbe ni kuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Aho kili ikimba naho hakukimala ndege nyika.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo mvele abanikilwe ni mgosiwe na Mlamuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu niyo awagambila wanamp'hina wakwe mliganyizo, uwahinize kugamba, waungwa kulombeza haheina kufa chevu. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />“Kwandaga na mlamuzi mwo mzi umwenga, hemogohaga Mnungu hegu mnt'hu yeyose. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Umwo mwandaga na mvele yumwenga abanikilagwa ni mgosiwe. Nakamwitila itila yudya mlamuzi akamgamba ‘Hake kilamuile miye no mwiihi ywangu!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwa mazuwa mengi yudya mlamuzi andaga akalemela, mna vize vigendeele niyo agamba hata uneva hikumogoha Mnungu na want'hu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />kwe nk'huswa nk'huswa akunink'ha uyu mvele, neni ikaule imbuli yakwe nimwink'he yadya awagilwe. Hinamwink'hile naanisokeze kwa kunibasa basa!”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Naho Zumbe agendelaaga akagamba, “Tegelezeni mlamuzi aihile ivo alongaga. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Togleni! Kigambe Mnungu haawatowanile wadya awasagule wakumwiila kilo na msi? Naho naande na kisese mo kuwambiza awant'hu awo? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nawagambilani, naawenk'he ludole yadya wawagilwe. Mna Mwana wa Mnt'hu naabwiile mhuwi umwo akeza?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we falisayo na mtoza kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Iviya iviya Yesu nakawagambila mliganyizo want'hu wadya wakukeona wedi naho wawasinyaga watuhu. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Kwandaga na want'hu waidi waitaga kwo kumlombeza Mnungu, yumwenga andaga mfalisayo, mtuhu naye andaga mtoza kodi.<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Yudya mfalisayo niyo akimaala akamlombeza Mnungu kwo umoyo wakwe akagamba, “Mnungu, nakutogola kwaviya miye hiyo enga want'hu watuhu wagubaguba, hewekuhuwilwa, wahabwasi, naho hiyo enga uyu mtoza kodi. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Miye nafunga mazuwa maidi mwa kila mazuwa mfungate naho naliha imwenga ya mlongo mwe viya hupata.”<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Mna mtoza kodi, akimaalaga luhale niyo yanda ogohaga hata kwinuila meso yakwe kulanga, akatowa mwekifua chakwe na kugamba, “Mnungu, nifiile mbazi miye Mwavu!” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Nawagambilani, mtoza kodi, aitaga kaya amuwagile Mnungu, kujink'ha yudya mfalisayo, kwaviya yudya akukeinula naakinywe hasi, mna akukebela naatunywe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awavikila wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Want'hu niyo wamwigaila Yesu wana wadodo vileke awagelekele mikono. Wanamp'hina weze wawaone, niyo wawativila, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />mna Yesu niyo awetanga wadya wana akagamba, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kwangu, msekuwafingiza, kwaviya Useuta wa Mnungu wiikiwa want'hu enga awa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nawagambilani ikindedi, mnt'hu yeyose hakuuhokela Useuta wa Mnungu enga mwana mdodo heengile uko.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnt'hu mgoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Kilongozi yumwenga ywa dini, amuuzaga Yesu akamgamba, “Mhinizi ywedi, nitende vivihi vileke ningile kwo ugima wa mazuwa yose?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu niyo amuuza, “Nii wanigamba ywedi? Hakuli mnt'hu ywedi, ywedi ni yumwenga du, naye ni Mnungu ekedu. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Kuimanya imiko, ‘Usekunda mhabwasi, usekukoma, usekubawa, usekudant'ha, uwogohe nyokwe na iso.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo ahitula kugamba, “Ayo yose hiyatoza kukongela udodo wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu eze eve ivo, niyo amgamba yudya mnt'hu, “Kusigaza kint'hu kimwenga cho kudamanya. Taga vose viya unanavo, uwapangile wakiwa amatundu, niho nounde no ugoli uko kwe mbingu, akajika wize unitimile.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Mna yudya mnt'hu eze eve ivo, niyo engila kinyulu, kwaviya andilisaga mgoli.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu nakamuona yudya mnt'hu kugamba kengilwa ni kinyulu, “Niyo agamba, ni vidala vitendese kwa mgoli kwingila kwo Useuta wa Mnungu! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Naho ni vihufu vitendese ngamia kombokela mwe dilanga dye singano kujink'ha mgoli kwingila mo Useuta wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Wadya want'hu weze weve niyo wamuuza Yesu, “Haluse ni ani naayokolwe?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu niyo ahitula, “Heyekudahika kwa want'hu, kwa Mnungu yadahika.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Petulo niyo amgamba, “Kaula suwe kileka kaya zetu niyo chakutimila weye.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Heiye, naho nawagambilani ikindedi, yeyose akuleka kaya yakwe, na mkaziwe na wandugu na welesi wakwe, kwa kuuzungula Useuta wa Mnungu, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />naahokele vitendese ivi haluse, akajika naho ugima wa mazuwa yose kwa mazuwa ya kwiza.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimuila malavo ya katatu mbuli ye file yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu niyo awaguha wadya mlongo na waidi no kuwagamba, “Kauleni chaita Yelusalemu, kudya kila kiya kiwandikwe na walotezi, mo Mwana ywa Mnt'hu nekilaile. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Kwaviya naageligwe mwe mikono ya want'hu hewemmanyize Mnungu, nawambele, nawamtendele kasidi, nokumtweela mate. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Nawamtowe mikotya no kumkoma mna mwe dizuwa dya katatu, naauyuke.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Mna hawakombaganye dyodyose mwa ayo alongile, kia alongile nekikefisa kwawe, naho hawamanyize yadya alongile.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amhonya mnt'hu mant'hunt'hu kilombezi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu eze ande hagihi na Yeliko, handaga na mnt'hu yumwenga mant'hunt'hu, ekale hagihi ne sila akalombeza. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Eze eve idifyo dya want'hu dyomboka, niyo auza, “Kuna mbwai?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Niyo wamgamba, “Yesu wa Nazaleti omboka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Niyo agutila akagamba, “Yesu, mwana Daudi nifiile mbazi!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Wadya want'hu walongole niyo wamtivila no kumgamba anyamale, Mna yehe niyo ongezelesa kugutila akagamba, “Mwana wa Daudi nifiile mbazi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Niyo Yesu akimaala no kusigila wamwigale kwakwe yudya mant'hunt'hu. Eze abule hagihi niyo Yesu amuuza, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Waunga hutendelei?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Niyo ahitula, “Zumbe, naunga nivuzilwe ukuona.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Ona, mhuwi wako ukuhonya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Aaho niyo anda akaula vedi, niyo amtimila Yesu akamtogola Mnungu. Want'hu weze waone ayo niyo wamtogola Mnungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu niyo engila mo mzi wa Yeliko, Umwo akajink'ha mwe izisila zo mzi uwo, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />niyo alaila mn'thu yumwenga zina dyakwe Zakayo. Uyo na kanda kilongozi mkulu wa watoza ushulu naho andaga mgoli. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Zakayo naakaungisa amwone Yesu, mna Kwaviya no kunda na lukudidi lwa want'hu lulongozane na yehe andaga mgihi ivo niyo adunduga kumuwona. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Mna niyo aguluka kulongole, nokukwela mnanga mwo mkuyu vileke amwone Yesu viya akomboka. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Mna Yesu eze abule hadya ho mkuyu niyo asinya kulanga, amgamba Zakayo, “Zakayo sela, dyelo nenisinde kwe inyumba yako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakayo niyo asela nguvu, nakumhokela kwa kinyemi. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Want'hu wose weze waone ayo, niyo wakonga kunung'uzika wakagamba, “Kagenda kwikala na mnt'hu mta wavu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Mna Zakayo niyo akimaala nokumgambila Yesu, “Zumbe, tegeleza, miye neniwenk'he wakiwa hindi dyo ugoli wangu, naho hegu himhoka mnt'hu kint'hu chochose nenimvuzile malavo kane.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Dyelo uhonyi ubula mwe nyumba ino, Kwaviya uyu naye ni mwe lukolo lwa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Kwaviya mwana wa Adamu keza kuzungula hamwenga na kuhonya kiya chagile.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we ditundu dyagile dya zahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayo 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Viya want'hu wandaga wagendeela kumtegeleza, Yesu niyo awagambila mliganyo, Kwaviya na kanda hagihi na Yelusalemu, naho woho nawamanya kugamba Useuta wa Mnungu u haguhi kwiza. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Na handa na mnt'hu yumwenga mkulu aitaga nt'hambo kwe isi ya hale vileke ahokele ukulu we kiseuta, niyo auya. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Mna viya andile akei kuhalawa niyo awetanga wandima wakwe mlongo, niyo awenk'ha kila yumwenga tundu dye zahabu, no kuwagamba, Kauleni ivo mkuunga mdamanye na amatundu aya Umwo nnanda kwe nt'hambo.” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Mna want'hu we Isi idya na wanda hawakumuunga yudya mkulu, ivo niyo wasigila want'hu waite wakamgambile, “Hakikumuunga mnt'hu uyu kunda Zumbe dyetu.”<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Yudya mnt'hu na kaupata kale Useuta, eze auye niyo awetanga wandima wadya awenk'hile amatundu vileke amanye upati uwo wapatile. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mndima wa nk'hongo niyo alaila na kumgamba, “Mkulu, hipata kint'hu malavo mlongo kulawa mwe diya tundu dimwenga.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Niyo amgamba, “Vedi, weye wi mndima mhuwilwa. Kwaviya kudamanya vedi mwe mbuli ndodo na winde mdahi mwe mizi mlongo.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Mndima wa kaidi niyo eza na kugamba, “Mkulu hipata kint'hu malavo shano kulawa mwe diya tundu dimwenga unink'hile.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Yudya naye niyo amgamba, “Nounde mkulu mwe mizi mishano.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mndima mtuhu niyo eza, nokumgamba, zumbe, “Guha tundu dyako, nahidifundika vedi mwe kitambala. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ne hukogoha Kwaviya weye wi mdala, wahausa kint'hu hukiikile naho wavuna hant'hu hwi hahandile.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Niyo amgamba, “Weye ni mtumwa wiihile, nousengelwe kwa yadya ulongile weye mwenye. Kumanya kugamba miye ni mnt'hu mdala nahausa kint'hu hikiikile no kuvuna hant'hu hihandile. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Ni huikize tundu dyangu kwe kindolo hegu nedyeleka?”<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Niyo awagamba wadya wakimale hagihi, ‘Guheni ditundu idyo ananadyo nokumwink'ha yudya mta matundu mlongo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Mna niyo wamgamba, ‘Mkulu, mna uyu mna ananayo mlongo?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Mna Yesu niyo awahitula, ‘Mta ikint'hu noongezelwe na yudya heena kint'hu hata kiya kidodo ananacho naahokigwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Naho wadya hewekuunga ninde Zumbe wawe, waleteni aha muwakome!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila Yelusalemu kwa kwanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu eze abinde kulonga ayo, niyo awalongoela kwita Yelusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Viya eze atende ehagihi na Betifage na Besania, hagihi no lugulu lwe mizeituni, niyo awasigila wanamp'hina wakwe waidi, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />niyo awagamba, “Iteni mwe kaya i hagihi na nyuwe, nombwiile mwana mp'hunda kakakigwa luzigi naho akei kwinula mnt'hu yeyose. Mfunguleni mumnetele aha.”<figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mwana mp'hunda </figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Uneva mnt'hu yeyose anamiuzani, nii mwamfungula mwana mp'hunda, mgambileni ivi, Zumbe amwunga.<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Niyo waita, nakumbwiila yudya mwana mp'hunda enga viya wagambilwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Umwo wakamfungula yudya mp'hunda, wenye niyo wauza, “Nii mwaifungula imp'hunda iyo?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Niyo wahitula, “Zumbe aiunga.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Niyo waigala idya mp'hunda kwa Yesu, niyo watandika izisuke zawe mnanga mwe mp'hunda, Yesu niyo akwela mnanga. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu niyo agendeela ne int'hambo mnanga mwe imp'hunda, na want'hu watandikaga izisuke zawe mwe isila.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Eze atende ehagihi na Yelusalemu mwe seleza yo lugulu lwe mizeituni, wanamp'hina wakwe wangaga wakamtogola Mnungu kwe mbuli nk'hulu wazione. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Niyo wakonga kugamba, “Katogoleswa Zumbe akwiza kwa zina dya Mnungu, utondowazi kwe mbingu na uwedi utendese kwa Mnungu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Mafalisayo watuhu wadile mwe difyo niyo wamgamba, “Mhinizi, wagambile wanamp'hina wako wanyamale.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nawagambilani wanakimala awa, amaiwe yadaha kutoa nk'helegele.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awiila mzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Eze abule hagihi na kuusinya udya umzi wa yelusalemu, Yesu niyo awiila. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Niyo amgamba, “Uneva wamanyize yadya yakuungigwa dyelo kwe mbuli yo utondowazi, mna ivi haluse ifisigwa kwako.” <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Mna mazuwa nayabule, wadya hewe kukuunga nawakuzungulusile ukuta, na kukukump'hukila mp'hande zose. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Nawakukome weye na wanao, hawakwasile iwe mnanga mwe iwe Kwaviya hwamanyize umuda wa Mnungu kwiza kukukombola.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yesu niyo engila mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu na kukonga kuwalava wadya wandile wakataga ivint'hu, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />niyo awagamba, “Iwandikwa, inyumba yangu ne inde nyumba ya kulombeza Mnungu, mna nyuwe mwaitenda mp'hanga ya wabavi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kila zuwa Yesu naakahiniza mwe Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, mna wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wahinizi we miko na vilongozi nawakazungula sila uleke wamkome. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Mna hawaone sila ya kumkomela, Kwaviya want'hu wose na wakamtegeleza vedi vidala.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli yo udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Zuwa dimwenga Yesu umwo andaga mwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu akahiniza want'hu, hamwenga na kubilikiza Mbuli Yedi ya Mnungu, wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wahinizi we miko, na wadala vilongozi niyo weza. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Niyo wagamba, “Kigambile, wadamanya mbuli izi kwa udahi waani?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Name neniwauzeni mbuli imwenga. Nigambileni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Yohana naakabatiza kwa udahi kulawa kwo ulanga hegu kwa want'hu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Mna niyo wakonga kulafya woho wenye, “Nemkigeeze? ‘Kinagamba yalawa kwa Mnungu,’ yehe naye naakiuze, ‘Nii hamwamhuwilaga?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Naho kinagamba noulawa kwa want'hu, want'hu awa wadaha kukitoa maiwe, Kwaviya nawamhuwila Yohana kugamba ni Mlotezi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Mna niyo wamhitula, “Hakimanyize uko ulaile.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Name hikuwagambilani nadamanya aya, kwa udahi wa ani.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo wo mgunda we mizabibu na walimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu niyo agendeela kuwagambila mliganyizo uno, “Mnt'hu yumwenga nakalima mgunda wakwe we mizabibu, niyo aikiza kwa wandima, yehe mwenye niyo atamba kwiita isi ya hale na kwikala uko kwa lupisi mtali. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Lupisi uvuni wize ubuze, yudya mnt'hu niyo amsigila mtumwa ywakwe kwa wadya wandima akaguhe ulozo yapatikane. Mna wadya wandima niyo wamtoa yudya mtumwa na kumleka auye haheina kumwink'ha kint'hu chochose. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Yudya mnt'hu niyo amsigila mtumwa mtuhu, yudya nae niyo wamtoa enga viya wamtoile yudya wa nk'hongo, na kumtendela viihile na kumvuza heheina kumwink'ha kint'hu chochose. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Niyo asigila mtuhu wa katatu, uyu naye niyo wamtoa na kumgela nkwenge niyo naho wamdula kuse. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Yudya zumbe mta mgunda niyo afanyanya, ‘Nentende vivihi? Nenimsigiile mwanangu humwungisa, wadaha wakamwiva.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Wadya wandima weze wamuwone yudya mwana niyo wagambilana, ‘Uyu nuyo mkipe, haluse kimkome vileke uno ulisi unde wetu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Niyo wamlava mwe idya ink'honde, wamkoma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu niyo auza, “Uyu zumbe mta mgunda naatende mbwai na wadya wandima?” <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />“Neeze awakome wadya wandima na kuwenk'ha wandima watuhu idya ink'honde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Want'hu weze weve zia izimbuli niyo wamhinga wagamba, “Iyo ivo haikudahika.”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu niyo awakaula na kuwauza, “Haluse uno Mawandiko Akukile yanakibwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Iwe wadilemele wazesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">Ditenda iwe kulu dikuungiswa kujink'ha yose.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mnt'hu yeyose anagwa mnanga mwe diya idiiwe naakant'hike vitilitili, naho dinamgwela mnt'hu yeyose nemdimtigint'he tiki tiki.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Wahinyi we miko hamwenga na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko niyo wazungula kumgwila lupidi ludya mna niyo wogoha want'hu Kwaviya nawamanya mliganyo udya naukawalonga woho. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Mna niyo wazungula mizungu ya kumgwila Yesu, nawasigila want'hu waketendile enga want'hu wedi vileke wamgwile mwo kulonga kwakwe uleke wamwigale kwe uzumbe na kwa wata udahi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Wadya wasigilwe niyo wamgamba Yesu, “Mhinizi kimanya kugamba walonga na kuhiniza mbuli za kindedi, naho hukukaula ukulu wa mnt'hu mna wahiniziza mbuli ya Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Hake kigambile, ni vedi kuliha kodi kwa Seuta ywa Kilumi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Mna Yesu nakamanya ubala wawe niyo awagamba, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />nilagiseni iditundu. Ifuta ne dizina ni va ani?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Niyo wamhitula, “Va Seuta ywa Kilumi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Vedi, mwink'heni Seuta ywa Kilumi va Kaisali na Mnungu mwink'heni vakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Niyo elo, hawadahile kumgwila kwa mbuli yoyose hadya ha want'hu, nawekehelwa na viya endile akawahitula niyo wanyamala.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuuyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Mna masadukayo, wadya wakugamba hakuhali kuuyuka, niyo wamuuza Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Mhinizi, “Musa nakakiwandikila kugamba, ‘Uneva mnt'hu anabanikilwa na nduguye mta mvele mna hana mwana yudya mnt'hu adaha kumguha yudya mvele uleke ampatile nduguye mwana.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />No kunda na wandugu mfungate, wa nk'hongo nakalomba mvele niyo abanika hana mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Wakaidi niyo amguha yudya mvele nae niyo abanika haheina kwasa mwana, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />na wakatatu. Niyo vanda ivo kwa ndugu wose mfungate. Wose niyo wafa haheina kweleka mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Niyo yudya mvele naye abanika. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Haluseelo, mwe dizuwa dyo kuuyuka kwa wabanike, yudya mvele na ande mkazaani Kwaviya wose nawamlomba.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Want'hu mwe ino isi walomba na kulombigwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />mna wadya wakunga wauyulwe kulawa kwe file na kwikala kwa Mnungu, hawakulomba na kulombigwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Naho hawabanike vituhu, Kwaviya na watende enga mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu. Na wende wana wa Mnungu Kwaviya wauyuka kulawa kwe file. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Mna mbuli ya kuuyuka nk'hindedi, hata Musa kailonga mwa maandiko Akukile wakwe. Mwe mbuli idya ya kadya kaziti kakuhya, hadya amwitange Zumbe kugamba ni ‘Mnungu wa Ibulahimu, na Mnungu wa Isaka na Yakobo.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yehe ni Mnungu wa wadya wa wagima hiyo wadya wabanike Kwaviya kwa yehe wose wana ugima.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Wahinyi watuhu we miko iyo wamhitula no kugamba, “Mhinizi kuhitula vedi vidala.”<verse eid="LUK 20:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Niyo hawamuuzile vituhu.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli mwa Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Want'hu wagaaze kugamba Kilisito ni mwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />‘Kwaviya Daudi ye mwenye nakalonga mwe ikitabu chakwe che zabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">zumbe nakamgamba zumbe ywangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">ikala nt'hendelo yangu ya kulume,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mpaka niwatende wadya waihi wako kunda kint'hu che kwiikila iviga vako.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Daudi amwitanga Yesu ‘Zumbe’ naatende vivihi mwanawe?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asimwiila mwe mbuli ya wahinizi we miko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Umwo want'hu wandaga mwo kumtegeleza niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Wakauliseni wahinizi we miko wakuungisa kugenda wavaile nk'hanzu na kulamswa mwa magwilo hamwenga na kwikala mwe nyumba za Mnungu na mwo ukalo wakulongole mwe zifugo. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Wakudya mwe zinyumba za wabanikilwe ni wagosi wawe. Kwa udant'hi wawe wamlombeza Mnungu kwa milosi mingi, woho nawasengelwe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Malavo ya abanikilwe ni mgosiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu niyo enula meso yakwe na kukaula wagoli ivo wakulava, malavo mwe kindolo. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Naho niyo amuwona mvele yumwenga abanikilwe ni mgosiwe alavile watundu wakwe waidi. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Nawagambilani ikindedi, mvele uyu abanikilwe ni mgosiwe kalava malavo makulu mwe iki kindolo kujink'ha wose. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kwaviya want'hu wose walava malavo yawe mwe amatundu yadya yongezekele, mna uyu mvele na ukiwa ananao kalava kia kikuunga kimwambize mwe wikazi wakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli yo kumoligwa Inyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Want'hu watuhu nawakalonga mbuli ye Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu, uwedi wakwe na viya dihambigwe kwa maiwe hamwenga na malavo want'hu nawakalava, Yesu niyo agamba, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Yano yose mkuyakaula, mazuwa yeza hadisigale iwe mnanga mwa mnyawe hedimoligwe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makunt'ho na masulmizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Mna niyo wamwuza, “Mhinizi mbuli izo nezilaile ini? Naho mbuli zani zikunga zilagise kugamba mbuli izo zihagihi kulaila?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu niyo awahitula, “Kauleni sema mnadantilizwe. Kwaviya want'hu wengi naweze kwe dizina dyangu wakagamba, ‘Miye nuyo Yesu!’ na ‘udya umuda wihagihi!’ mna nyuwe msekuwabasa. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Mna mneva mbuli za nk'hondo, na seselo za nk'hondo msekogoha, mbuli izo zaungigwa zinde kulaila. Mna udya umwisho nounde ukei.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yesu niyo agendeela kuwagambila, “Isi naitoane na isi nt'huhu, na useuta nautoane na useuta mtuhu.” <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Nokunde na visingisa va isi kila hant'hu, na gumbo, na unyonge wa tauni kila hant'hu na mbuli za wogofi hamwenga na vilagiso kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Umwo yose ayo hayanati kulaila, nawamigwileni na kuwatoa, hamwenga na kuwegalani mwe zinyumba za Mnungu na kuwavugaila mndani, na mlongelezwe kwa mazumbe na maliwale mwe mbuli ye dizina dyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Aho elo naho mkuungigwa mlonge uwona mwe mbuli yedi ya Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Mna msekogoha na kubanikanyanya mwe imioyo yenyu kugamba nomlonge mbwai. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Kwaviya neniwenk'heni mbuli zedi zo ukulonga zikunga zileke wakumihiya wasekudaha kuhigana nanywe. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Nomlemelwe na welesi wenyu na wandugu zenyu hamwenga na wambuya zenyu, na watuhu nao nawamikomeni. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Want'hu wose nawamiihieni Kwaviya mkunitimila miye. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Mna hata fili imwenga mwe imitwi yenyu heyage. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kwaviya mkufinyiliza, nomhonye imioyo yenyu.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ye kubanangwa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Aho mkunga muwone mzi wa Yelusalemu uzungulukwa na wank'hondo, naho kumbukileni kugamba umuda wakwe wa kubanangwa ubula. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Niyo elo wadya we Yudeya wagulukile kwe imilima, wadya we kwo mzi wafose, na wadya we kwe zink'honde wasekuya kwo mzi wa yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Kwaviya mazuwa ayo ni amazuwa ya masulumizo, vileke yakelavilize yadya yawandikwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Nk'hondo ina wavele wabovu na wadya wakonk'heza mwe amazuwa ayo, Kwaviya nokunde na masulumizo mengi mwe isi na maya ya Mnungu nayawezile want'hu awa. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Watuhu nawakomwe na mabamba, watuhu nawatahigwe kulawa mwe zisi zose, na mzi wa Yelusalemu nouguhigwe na want'hu wa isi nt'huhu mpaka lupisi wawe wize usile.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwiza kwa Mwana wa Mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Nokutende na vilagiso kwe dizuwa, no umnenge na kwe zint'hondo. Isi zose nezitende na masulumizo, wose nawengile mtuso kwo msindo wo mjubwaniso we ibahali. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Want'hu wengilaga kizingizo cha wogofi, kwa yadya yakuunga yalaile mwe isi yose, kwaviya udahi wa kwe mbingu nousingisike. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Aaho niho nawamwone Mwana wa Adamu akaseela na mavunde kulawa kwa Mnungu, kamema udahi mkulu na uwedi utendese. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Umwo izimbuli izo zikakonga kulaila sangalaleni, nokwinula imitwi yenyu Kwaviya uhonyi wenyu uhagihi.<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mliganyizo we mti ukwitangwa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesu niyo awagambila umliganyizo uno, “Ukauleni ivo wili mtini ne miti mituhu yose. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Mtini unakonga kusuka mani, aho nommanye umuda we kiangazi wihaguhi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Saivo, mneza kuwona mbuli izo zikalaila mmanye kugamba Useuta wa Mnungu wihagihi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Nawagambilani ikindedi, cheleko iki, hechomboke ayo yakanda yakei kulaila. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Mbingu ne isi vyose nevomboke, mna ulosi wangu howomboke na zuwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaungwa kunda meso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mkekaulise, imiyoyo yenyu, inase ikazamilwa ni uhank'hu na ukolwa ne zimbuli zo wikazi aya, zuwa diya niyo dyamizilani enga viya lwinika ukugwila. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Kwaviya zuwa idyo nediwezile enga viya lwinika ukufyuka kwa wose wakwikala mwe Isi. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Sinyiseni, lombezeni Mnungu mazuwa yose vileke mpate udahi ukunga vileke mjink'he vedi mwe izimbuli zose zikunga zilaile, naho uleke mnde na udahi wakukimala kwakwe mwana wa Adamu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kila zuwa Yesu naakahiniza mwe nyumba ya nk'hulu ya Mnungu, naho nekilo naakaita kwo kugona kwo lugulu lwe mizeituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Want'hu wose na wakaita kwe Nyumba nk'hulu ya Mungu vileke wamtegeleze.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Mizungu ya kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Zuwa dye kinyemi che mikate heigeligwe ugwadu, dikwitangwa pasaka, dyandaga hagihi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, na wahinizi wasigilwe, wandaga wakawogoha want'hu, na ivo wandaga wakageza kuzungula mizungu ya kumkoma Yesu kinyele.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda azumila kumsezenga Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Mwavu amwingilaga Yuda akwitangwa Isikaliyote yumwenga mwa wadya mlongo na waidi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Yuda niyo agenda kulonga na wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, wakulu wa wank'hondo, wamizi we Nyumba ink'hulu yo kuvikila, ivo akuunga amsezenge Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Welelagwa vidala niyo wamgeleka matundu. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda azumilaga, niyo akonga kuzungula luneka lwedi, lwakumgela Yesu mwe mikono yawe kwa kinyele.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akeika Lumwe Kuidya Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Niyo dyabula di zuwa dye mikate heigeligwe ugwadu, dizuwa dyo kuchinja ingoto ye pasaka <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Niyo Yesu awasigiila Petulo, na Yohana akawagamba, “Iteni mka kiikile lumwe ludyo lwe pasaka kize kidye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Niyo wamuuza, “Waunga kikaikilehi lumwe ludyo lwe pasaka?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Niyo awagamba, “Umwo mkengila mo mzi, nombwiilane na mnt'hu aketwikile biga dya mazi, mtimileni mkengile kwenyumba akugenda kwingila. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Mgambeni mta inyumba, ‘Zumbe auza chumba akuunga adiile uludyo lwe pasaka hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Naawalagiseni chumba kikulu chedi kwe digulu, uko nombwiile vint'hu vose viikilwa lumwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Waitaga niyo wakubwiila enga viya Zumbe Yesu awagambile, niyo nao waikila lumwe uludyo lwe pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludyo lwa Zumbe Yesu lwa mwalagulo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinso 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Umwo sa ize ibuze niyo ekala ho ludyo hamwenga na wegala ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Hionesa kunda vedi vitendese kudya pasaka ino hamwenga na nyuwe, hinati kusulumizwa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Kwaviya nawagambilani, heniidye naho ino mpaka ikeza kukelaviliza mwo useuta wa Mnungu<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Niyo naho Yesu akiguha kikombe, nokutogola Mnungu, niyo agamba, “Nyweeleni nyose mwe kikombe iki. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Nawagambilani kugamba, heniywe naho mazi aya ye zabibu mpaka Useuta wa Mnungu wize.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Niyo auguha mkate, atogola Mnungu, niyo aubendula nokuwenk'ha akawagamba, “Uno nuwo umwili wangu ukulavilwa kwajili yenyu, tendeni ivi kwa kunikumbukila.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Viligane naivo, weze wabinde ludyo lwa mwalagulo, niyo awenk'ha kikombe akawagamba, “Ikikombe iki niyo indagano imp'ya ya Mnungu mwe sakame yangu, ikwitika kwajili yenyu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Mna kauleni, yudya akunisezenga ehamwenga na miye ha ludyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mwana Mnt'hu naafe enga viya Mnungu aungile Mna naaligitwe mnt'hu yudya akuunga amsezenge.”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Niyo wakonga kuuzana woho wenye kwa wenye ni ani mwa woho akuunga atende ivo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiganila ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Niyo kwalaila mahigano mwa wanamp'hina, kugamba ni ani mwa woho akufanyanywa kunda mkulu ywawe. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Maseuta wa want'hu hewe mmanyize Mnungu we kindedi, wana udahi mwa want'hu wawe, na wakulu nawo wakeink'ha ukulu wakakegamba, ‘Wambuya wa want'hu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Mna kwenyu hivo ivo, mkulu umwenyu, aungwa ande mdodo kujink'ha wose, naho, kilongozi naye, aungwa ande mtumwa wa want'hu. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Mna niani mkulu, ni yudya akwikala hasi ho ludyo, hegu yudya akunda mndima? Ikindedi ni yudya akuhumula hasi. Mna hata inanda ivo miye ni mwenyu enga mndima.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Nyuwe mnda na miye mo kugezigwa kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />naho enga viya Tate aniikile mo Useuta, miye name nawaikani mo uzumbe uuwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Nomdye na kunywa ho ludyo kwo uzumbe wangu, naho nomwikale mwe difumbi dyo Useuta kuzilamula kabila mnongo na mbili za Wazilaeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alotela ivo Petulo akuunga amkane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Simoni! Simoni! Kaula Mwavu kenk'wa kuwageza nyuwe nyose, kuwapanga awedi na waihile, enga viya mlimi akuiheta ingano. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Mna hikulombezela kwa Mnungu weye, Simoni, unase kuhungukilwa nu mhuwi, vileke ukeza kuniuiya uwagele nguvu wanduguzo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Petulo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe miye hikeika lumwe kugenda kuvugailwa kwedi vugailo naho hegu kubanika nife hamwenga na weye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nakugambila Petulo, zogolo he diile, weye nounde kunilemela malavo nt'hatu kugamba hunimanyize.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pochi na Mkwiji na Bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yesu niyo awauza wanamp'hina wakwe, “Viya nawasigilagani, hewiina pochi hegu mkwiji na vilatu, mwahungukilagwa ni chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Niyo wamhitula, “Hachahungukilwe na chochose.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Mna haluse, mta pochi hegu mkwiji, naaguhe, heena bamba, naaungwe kutaga dikoti vileke agule bamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Kwaviya nawagambilani, yadya niwandikilwe yakugamba, ‘Naawazigwe hamwenga na wabanangi,’ yaungwa yakelavilize naho kindedi yadya niwandikilwe haluse yabula.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Wana mp'hina niyo wagamba, “Zumbe kaula, aha kina mabamba maidi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Yesu niyo agamba, “Ni vedi!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alombeza Mnungu ko mnima we mizeituni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu ahalawaga ho mzi niyo aita kwo mlima we mizeituni, enga ivo akutendaga, wanamp'hina nao niyo waita nae. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Eze abule hant'hu aho niyo awagamba, “Mlombeze kugamba msekugwa mwo kugezigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Niyo asogela hank'handa nao uhale wa kuvigita iwe, niyo afika madi na kumnombeza Mnungu akagamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Niyo agamba, “Tate, uneva waunga, niusile masulumizo aya, hiyo kwa kuunga kwangu, mna viya ukuunga weye nevinde.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu wa Mnungu amwiziilaga na kumgela nguvu. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Kwaviya andile mwe makunt'ho, ongezaga kumnombeza Mnungu, niyo kiluke chakwe chanda enga matwent'he ya sakame ya kutomoka mwe sanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Eze alawe mo kumnombeza Mnungu niyo awauiya wanamp'hina wakwe, niyo awabwiila wagona Kwaviya nawanda na kinyulu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Niyo Yesu awagamba, “Nii mwagona? Inukeni mlombeze Mnungu, mnase kwingila mo kugezigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugwilwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohana 18:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Umwo Yesu andile akagendeela kulonga, dyabulaga fyo dikalongozwa ni Yuda, yumwenga mwa wadya wanamp'hina mlono na waidi. Ezaga na kumbusu Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Mna Yesu niyo amgamba, “Yuda wamsezenga Mwana wa Mnt'hu kwa utondwe?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Umwo wadya wanamp'hina weze wayaone yadya yakulaila niyo wamuuza, “Zumbe, togola kiwasenge na mabamba yetu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Yumwenga wawe niyo amtowa mtumwa ywo mkulu wa mlava nt'hambiko, na kumsenga digutwi dyo kulume.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Mna Yesu niyo agamba, “Yaungigwa muyazumile yano!” Niyo amtozaga yudya mnt'hu digutwi dyakwe disengigwe, nakumhonya.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Awagamba wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wadya wakulu wa wamizi we nyumba ink'hulu ya Mnungu, hamwenga ne wadala vilongozi, awo wezaga kumgwila Yesu, “Mwiza na mabamba na malungu, enga miye ni mhoki? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Nandaga na nyuwe mazuwa yose mwe nyumba nk'hulu ya Mnungu mna hamwagezile kunigwila. Mna dielo dibula dizuwa dyenyu, udahi wo uzumbe we diziza kukehuwila.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayo 26:57-58</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maliko 14:53-54</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohana 18:12-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Wamgwilaga Yesu niyo waita nae kwe nyumba yo mlava nt'hambiko mkulu Petulo naye andaga akatimila kwa luhale. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Weze wande wagima moto hagati he kiwasa cho usengelo, Petulo alunganaga na wadya wandaga wekale bunga kuuzunguluka. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Mvele yumwenga eze amuone Petulo kekala hadya ho moto, amngoelaga meso Petulo akagamba, “Mnt'hu uyu nae nawandanya na Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Mna Petulo niyo alemela akagamba, “We mvele, miye himmanyize mt'hu uyo!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ludodo naho mgosi yumwenga nakamuona Petulo, niyo agamba, “Weye nawe uyumwenga mwa woho,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Mna Petulo niyo amgamba, “Weye mnt'hu, himanyize icho ukulonga,”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Sa nt'huhu lupisi, mnt'hu mtuhu niyo alonga kwa kubilikiza, akagamba, “Hana kindedi chose kugamba, mnt'hu uyu nae nawandanya na Yesu, kwaviya yehe nae Mgalilaya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Mna Petulo niyo amhitula, “Weye mnt'hu, himanyize icho ukulonga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Aho, niyo zogolo dyaila. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Zumbe Yesu niyo ahituka no kumkaula Petulo, Niyo Petulo akumbukila yadya agambilwe ni Yesu kugamba, “Zogolo hadinati kuila nekilo, nounde kunilemela malavo nt'hatu kugamba hunimanyize.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Petulo niyo aita kuse, niyo ailisa kwa usungu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atendelwa lubezo no kutoigwa mikotya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Wadya wandaga wakamwamila Yesu niyo wamtendela lubezo no kumtoa mikotya. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Wamsitaga ameso niyo wamuuza wakamgamba, “Ni ani akutoile?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Niyo wamlonga mbuli nyingi zakumhomola.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwe kitala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohana 18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Kwize kuche, difyo dye vilongozi wa want'hu, wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko, na wahiniza miko, waduganaga hamwenga niyo Yesu aletwa he kitala. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Niyo wamgamba, “Kigambile, weye ni weye Kilisito?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Niyo ahitula, “Hata uneva nna wagambilani, homnihuwile. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Naho nnawauzani, homnihitule. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Mna, kulawa ivi haluse, Mwana ywa Mnt'hu naande kekala kulume kwo Useuta wa Mnungu ywo Udahi wose.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Niyo wose wagamba, “Haluse, weye niwe Mwana Mnungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Niyo awahitula, “Ivo mkulonga nivo nili.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Niyo wagamba, “Chazungula ikindedi kihi naho? Kiva yehe mwenye ivo alongile.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Want'hu wose niyo wenuka, wamlongaza Yesu kwita kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Uko wakongaga kumlongeleza wakagamba, “uyu mnt'hu kimbwiila akawadant'hiliza want'hu, naakawafingiza want'hu wasekuliha kodi kwa Seuta ywa Kilumi, naho nakagamba yehe mwenye niye Zumbe Yesu Kilisito.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilato niyo amuuza Yesu, “Weye wi Zumbe wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu niyo amhitula, “ivo ukulonga niivo”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilato niyo awagamba wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wadya wose wandile hadya, “Hikuona wavu wowose mwe uyu mnt'hu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Mna wose niyo wagamba, “Awadant'hiliza want'hu na mahinyo yakwe mwe isi yose yo Uyahudi, kakongela Galilaya mna ivi haluse eyaha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilato eze eve ayo niyo auza, “Ivi mnt'hu uyu ni mkaya wa Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Eze amanye kugamba Yesu kalawa mwo udahi wa Helode, niyo amwigala kwa Helonde, lupisi ulwo Helode andaga Yelusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Helode niyo ehelwa vidala eze amwone Yesu. Kwaviya nakeva kale izimbuli zakwe, ivo naakaungisa amwone. Naho naakakawiila amwone Yesu akadamanya vihungi. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Ivo niyo amuuza Yesu maswali yabindile ingi, mna yehe Yesu hahitule dyodyose. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na wahinizi we Sigilizi, niyo wakimala wakamlongeleza kwa kuvilikiza vidala. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Ivo Helode hamwenga na watowani wakwe, niyo wamtendela lubezo Yesu, na kumlongela mbuli za soni, niyo wamvala suke za kiseuta na kumvuza kwa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Mwe dizuwa diya Helode na Pilato niyo watenda wambuya Kwaviya aho nk'hongo na wanda want'hu walemane.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asengelwa kukomwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Ivo Pilato niyo etanga kitala cha wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na vilongozi na want'hu watuhu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />awagamba, “Mniletela mnt'hu uyu mwagamba nakawadant'hiliza want'hu. Mna miye hiona izimbuli zakwe mwa meso yenyu naho hione mbuli yoyose iihile mwe ziya mumlongeleze. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Naho hiyo miye du, Helode naye haone wavu wowose, nivo vilekile kamvuza kwangu. Ni kindedi kugamba mnt'hu uyu hadamanye dyodyose dikuleka akantilwe kukomwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Miye nenizumile mumtoe niyo namlekela aite.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kwaviya neikamunga kuwakomwoela mvugailwa yumwenga mwe zuwa dyo wila we Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Mna niyo wose watoa lwasu kwa lumwe, wakagamba, “Muuse uyo umfungule Balaba.” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balaba nakavugailwa kwa kusaguka na kwajili yakukoma want'hu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilato nakaunga amlekele Yesu, “Ivo niyo alonga naho vituhu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Mna woho niyo watoa lwasu wakagamba, “Muwambe, muwambe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilato niyo awauzaga malavo ya katatu, “Mna kadamanya wiihi wani? Hikuona kint'hu chochose kiihile icho adamanye kikumuunga abanike. Nanizumile mumtoe akajika nenimlekele aite. <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Mna woho wagendeela kutoesa lwasu kugamba,” Yesu aungigwa awambigwe. Niyo elo lwasu lwawe lwahuma. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Pilato niyo azumila kugamba wadamanye ivo wakunga. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Niyo amkomwoela kulawa kwe divugailo yudya wakumuunga, yudya ageligwe kwedivugailo kwa kusaguka na kukoma want'hu. Pilato amlavaga Yesu kwawe vileke wamtendele viya wakuunga.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awambigwa mwo msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Umwo wakamwigala, wabwilana na mnt'hu yumwenga akwitagwa Simoni mnt'hu wa Kilene, andile akalawa kwo mgunda, niyo wamtwika msalaba kunyuma haguhi na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Fyo dya want'hu nedikamtimila, naho no kunda na wavele wandile wakamwiila Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu niyo awahitukila na kuwagamba, “Nyuwe wavele wa Yelusalemu, msekuniila miye keiileni nyuwe wenye na wana wenyu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Kwaviya mazuwa nayeze aho wakunga wagambe, ‘nevinde nivedi kwa wadya hewena wana, nawadya heweleke na kulela wana!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Aho noubuze lupisi want'hu wakunga wayagambe amagulu, yawagweele na kuwagubika vileke wafe. <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kwaviya uneva nawatenda ivo mwo mti heunyaile, neinde vivihi umti unanyala?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Niyo wegalwa want'hu watuhu waidi wandile wabanangi vileke wawambigwe hamwenga na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Weze wabule hant'hu hakwitangwa kibela cho mtwi, niyo wamuwamba Yesu hamwenga na wadya wabanangi waidi, yumwenga kulume kwakwe na mtuhu kumoso. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu niyo agamba, “Tate uwausile wavu wawe, kwaviya hawamanyize idyo wakudamanya,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Niyo wapangilana izisuke zakwe kwa kutoa kula. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Want'hu nawakimala hadya wakakaula, vilongozi nawakambela, wakagamba, “Kayokola watuhu haluse naakeyokole mwenye, uneva yehe nuyo Kilisito asagulwe ni Mnungu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Wank'hondo nawo niyo wambela, nawambasa Yesu hagihi niyo wamwink'ha siki. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Wamgamba, “Uneva kindedi weye u Zumbe ywa wayahudi, keyokole weye mwenye!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Halanga ho msalaba wakwe na hawandika, “Uyu niye Seuta ywa Wayahudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yumwenga mwe wadya wadamanye wiihi wawambigwe mwe viwambilo, niyo amhomola Yesu akamgamba, “Weye hikugamba niwe Kilisito? Hake keyokole wemwenye hamwenga na suwe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Mna yudya mtuhu niyo amtivila miyawe akamgamba, “Weye hukumogoha Mnungu! Mna umwe usengelo enga iyo? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Weye na miye kiwagilwa kwink'higwa usengelo enga ino, mwe yadya kidamanye mna uyu hadamanye mbuli yoyose iihile!” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Eze abinde ukulonga niyo agamba Yesu, “We Yesu unikumbukile Umwo ukeza mo Useuta wako.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu niyo amhitula amgamba, “Nakugambila, dyelo ino nekindanye kwa Useuta wa Mnungu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukubanika kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ize ibuze saa mtandatu niyo kwenda na lwiza mwe isi yose, mpaka mwe saa kanda. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Zuwa niyo dyatenda na lwilwa, pazia dye nyumba nk'hulu ya Mnungu niyo dyatatuka hagati. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu niyo aila kwa izwi kulu, “Tate mwe mikono yako nauika umoyo wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Yudya mkulu wa wank'hondo eze aone izimbuli viya zilaile, niyo amtogola Mnungu agamba, “Kindedi uyu mnt'hu na kanda mnt'hu wedi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Want'hu wose wadugane hadya, he idya imbuli, weze waone izimbuli zilaile, niyo wauya mwe zikaya zawe wakaketoa mwe vifuwa kwa usungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Mbuyaze Yesu hamwenga na wadya wavele wezile kulawa Galilaya nawakimala kwa hale ludodo wakakaula idyo dikulaila.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumoswa msanga ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />No kunda na mnt'hu yumwenga zina dyakwe Yusufu, mnt'hu uyo na kanda mnt'hu ywedi naho naakekala mo mzi umwenga wa wayahudi ukwitangwa Alimasaya. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Na kanda mnt'hu wa Alimatayo mzi umwenga wa Wayahudi, ywedi akutogolwa, naakagoja ukwiza kwa Useuta wa Mnungu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ivo yehe niyo aita kwa Pilato, aulombeza umwili wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Eze azumilwe niyo auseleza kwe umsalaba, auvika sanda yedi niyo akuumosa mwe mp'hanga ipukigwe mwo luwe lukulu, naho ne dinda hadinati kumwoselwa mnt'hu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Zuwa idyo na inda ijumaa, ye dizuwa dya kuhumula nayakonga.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Wadya wavele wezile na Yesu kulawa Galilaya, nawamtimila Yusufu, niyo waiona idya imp'hanga uikigwe umwili wa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Niyo wauya kwe zikaya zawe, waika vedi mafuta yedi yakuuhaka umwili wa Yesu. Zuwa dyo ukuhumula niyo wahumula hahena ndima yoyose, enga viya Umwiko ikulonga.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Ukuuyuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Jumapili mtootondo, wadya wavele niyo waita kwe mp'hanga na yadya mavuta yawe yo mhemp'he ayo wayaikile lumwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Niyo wadibwila dia diiwe ditongoloswa hale ne imp'hanga. Ilwe ditongoloswa hale ne mp'hanga, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />niyo wengila mndani mna hawauone umwili wa Zumbe Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Umwo wandile wakei wakehelwa, niyo kwalaila want'hu waidi wakimale hagihi na woho, wavalaga suke zikumwekamweka. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Wadya wavele niyo wengilwa ni wogofi na kufunama hasi uku wakanda wafika madi, wadya want'hu niyo wawagamba, “Nii mwamzungula mgima mwe want'hu wabanike? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Hahali, kauyuka, kumbukileni ivo amigambilgani umwo andaga Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Vaungwa mwana mnt'hu alavigwe mwe want'hu waihile na kuwambigwa mo msalaba na kuuyuka zuwa dya katatu.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Aaho, wadya wavele niyo wakumbukila ulosi wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Niyo wahalawa kudya kwe imp'hanga niyo wagenda kuwagambila wadya wanamp'hina wakwe mlongo na yumwenga hamwenga na want'hu watuhu izimbuli zose. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Wavele wadya wandaga ni Maliamu Magedalena na Yoana na Maliamu nine dya Yakobo, hamwenga na wadya wavele wandile we hamwenga, woho nawo wawagambile wegala ulosi izimbuli zose. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Mna wadya wanamp'hina nawakafanyanya kugamba yadya wagambigwe ni wadya wavele na hayandaga hiyo kindedi. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Mna Petulo niyo afosa niyo atula nguluko mpaka kwe imp'hanga niyo afunama asungile mndani, mna aonaga isanda iyo du. Niyo ehelwa kwa mbuli ziya azione niyo auya kaya.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lugendo lwa kuita Emau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maliko 16:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Mwe dizuwa idyo, want'hu waidi mwe wanamp'hina wakwe nawakaita mwe kaya imwenga ikwitagwa Emau, kaya iyo ihale no mzi wa Yelusalemu enga lugendo lwa masa maidi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Naho nawakalonga woho wenye diya dilaile, <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Umwo nawakalonga na kuuzana wo wenye, Yesu mwenye niyo alaila alongozana nawo, <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Nawamuona kwa meso mna hawammanyize kugamba ni Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mwasimuila mbuli yani uku mwagenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Woho niyo wakimala wanyamale wamemile kugela mbazi mwo uso. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yumwenga akwitangwa Kileopa, niyo amuuza, “Weye wi mgeni mo mzi uno wa Yelusalemu, vikutende humanyize idyo dilaila mwe yano amazuwa?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu niyo awauza, “Kulaila mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Woho niyo wamhitula, “Mbuli za Yesu wa Nazaleti,” yudya endile mlotezi, “Mta udahi wa kudamanya na kulonga hameso ha Mnungu na want'hu wose. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na awakulu wetu hamwenga na vilongozi, nawamsengela kubanika niyo wamuwamba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Naho suwe nakikakawiila kugamba yehe nuyo akuunga aikombole Izilaeli, mna dyelo ni zuwa dya katatu kukonge hadya zilaile izo izimbuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Naho weyuko wavele wachehele, nawaita mtootondo kwe kikuta, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />mna hawaubwiile umwili wakwe! Wauya nakugamba, walailwa ni mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu niyo awagambila kugamba, Kauyuka. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Weetu watuhu nawaita kwe kikuta niyo waona ivo walotezi wadya awavele, mna yehe hawamuwone.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Niyo Yesu awagamba, “Nii mwi wahezi ivo? Nii mwi wadala kuhuwila mbuli walotezi wa Mnungu! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Haiungigwe Kilisito kusulumizwa mwe zimbuli zose, na kwingila mwo uwedi utendese wo Useuta wakwe?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Niyo awagambila zimbuli zose awandikilwe mwa maandiko Akukile, kukongela mlotezi Musa mpaka walotezi wa Mnungu wose.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Weze wabule hagihi ne ikaya idya nawakaita, Yesu niyo awageza enga agendeela ne int'hambo, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />niyo woho wamlombeza kugamba, “Usekwita, zuwa diswa.” Ivo niyo engila he ikaya na kwikala nao. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Eze ekale na kudya nk'hande hamwenga nao, aguhaga mkate no kuuvikila, niyo aubendula no kuwenk'ha. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ahadya meso yawe niyo yagubulwa, no wabunk'hula kugamba ni Yesu, mna naho niyo ahalawa mwa meso yawe iviya wakakaula. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Niyo wagambana, “Togoleni, imyoyo yetu haikimpuke moto mndani, aho naakalonga naswe mwe sila, no kukigubuila Mawandiko Akukile?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Niyo wahalawa isa idya, no kuuya Yelusalemu. Uko wawabwilaga wadya mlongo na yumwenga, wadugana hamwenga na wadya watuhu. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Niyo wagamba, “Zumbe, kauyuka kindedi, naye kamlaila simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Niyo wawasimwiila yadya yalaile kwe sila, na viya wambunkhule Zumbe mwe kuubendula mkate.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanamp'hina wakwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Imitendele 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Umwo nawakawagambila ayo, Yesu mwenye niyo alaila no kukimala hagati hawe, awagamba, “Utondowazi unde na nyuwe.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Niyo wehelwa no kwingilwa ni wogofi mkulu, wakafanyanya kugamba walailwa ni mzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Mna yehe awagamba, “nii mwanda na kinyulu? Nii mwanda na shaka mwe imioyo yenyu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Kauleni mikono ne iviga vangu, vileke mmanye ni miye. Nitozeni mnione, Kwaviya mzimu hauna mwili na mavuha enga ivi mkuniyona.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Eze alonge ayo, niyo awalagisa miko ne iviga. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Umwa wandile wakei khuila kwa kinyemi wandile nacho, Yesu niyo awauza, “Mna kint'hu chochose cho kudya?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Niyo waamwink'ha nt'hili ye samaki ikasigwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yesu aiguhaga, na kuidya iviya wose wakamkaula.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Niyo awagamba, “Ino niyo imbuli nawagambilagani, viya chandile hamwenga, kugamba nehiungigwa kuyombokela yose nawandikilagwa mwe miko ya Musa enk'higwe ni Mnungu na mwe vitabu va walotezi hamwenga na mwe kitabu che Zabuli.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Niyo zifanyanyi zawe zagubuka, wakombaganya Mawandiko Yakukile. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Naho niyo awagamba, “Ivo nivo iwandikwe kugamba. Kilisito naasulumizwe mna mwe dizuwa dya katatu naauyuke. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Naho kwa zina dyakwe, want'hu wose kukongela Yelusalemu, nayabilikizwe kugamba want'hu waungigwa wakeiile vileke wausilwe wavu wawe. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Naho ni nyuwe muwone izi zimbuli. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Miye mwenye neniwegaileni yudya Tate alagane naamtume kwenyu, mna ikaleni umu mo mzi mpaka mwink'higwe udya udahi ukulawa kulanga.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apaa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maliko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Imitendele 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Niyo awalongoza mpaka Besania, uko nuko enulaga mikono yakwe no kuwavikila. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Umwo akawavikila, niyo akepagula no kuwasa, niyo aguhigwa kulanga kwe mbingu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Wamvikaga niyo wauya Yelusalemu uuku wana kinyemi kitendese. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Nawo nawekekala kwe inyumba nk'hulu ya Mnungu mazuwa yose, wakamtogola Mnungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>